(3202793, 449883, 63006, '<td valign="top">I wish her nose wer in the picture just a little more. from a glance, it looks as if it''s not there, kind of eerie</td>', 'I wish her nose wer in the picture just a little more. from a glance, it looks as if it''s not there, kind of eerie', '2007-01-10 00:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
