(3202977, 449098, 44453, '<td valign="top">you''ve got to love advanced editing, the sparkle in the eyes really dominates this photo.  Maybe the skin tones are a bit flat and in comparison to the bright eyes it makes the photo feel a bit unbalanced</td>', 'you''ve got to love advanced editing, the sparkle in the eyes really dominates this photo.  Maybe the skin tones are a bit flat and in comparison to the bright eyes it makes the photo feel a bit unbalanced', '2007-01-10 00:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3202979, 449766, 19982, '<td valign="top">Like the split lighting, well done there.  Wish her eyes were in sharper focus.</td>', 'Like the split lighting, well done there.  Wish her eyes were in sharper focus.', '2007-01-10 00:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3202988, 450054, 47316, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. The eyes really make this stand out in the thumbnail but on the photo it almost seems like too much. I think it''s because there is very little contrast in her skin and then the eyes have a ton of contrast. Perhaps adding some darker parts like in the creases of the mouht would have helped balance it?<br/> <br/>Other than that this is a lovely photo. Beautiful model, love the blurred background and choice of a darker coat.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. The eyes really make this stand out in the thumbnail but on the photo it almost seems like too much. I think it''s because there is very little contrast in her skin and then the eyes have a ton of contrast. Perhaps adding some darker parts like in the creases of the mouht would have helped balance it? Other than that this is a lovely photo. Beautiful model, love the blurred background and choice of a darker coat.', '2007-01-10 00:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3202991, 449084, 3569, '<td valign="top">too over exposed to me</td>', 'too over exposed to me', '2007-01-10 00:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3202998, 448540, 19982, '<td valign="top">The B&amp;W treatment is okay.  I just don''t "get" the pose... I don''t think it is very flattering for her (mainly due to her neck).  I think she could be made to look much more beautiful with a pose that would hide the slight double-chin and the lines on her neck.</td>', 'The B&W treatment is okay.  I just don''t "get" the pose... I don''t think it is very flattering for her (mainly due to her neck).  I think she could be made to look much more beautiful with a pose that would hide the slight double-chin and the lines on her neck.', '2007-01-10 00:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3202999, 450295, 47316, '<td valign="top">The light is really harsh as well as the blur. Beautiful little girl. A shot like this would certainly benefit from a softer smile.</td>', 'The light is really harsh as well as the blur. Beautiful little girl. A shot like this would certainly benefit from a softer smile.', '2007-01-10 00:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3203008, 449166, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting</td>', 'Nice lighting', '2007-01-10 00:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3203012, 449780, 19982, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and B&amp;W treatment.  It appears that his shirt is sharply in focus (at least the sides of his body), but his eyes appear out of focus.</td>', 'Nice lighting and B&W treatment.  It appears that his shirt is sharply in focus (at least the sides of his body), but his eyes appear out of focus.', '2007-01-10 00:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3203022, 448177, 19982, '<td valign="top">Happy indeed!  Bump up the contrast a bit and you''ve got a winning smile.</td>', 'Happy indeed!  Bump up the contrast a bit and you''ve got a winning smile.', '2007-01-10 00:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3203023, 449466, 47316, '<td valign="top">Nothing much going on here. Why have the focus be on the  blanket(?) instead of on the person? The light behind her head is really harsh.</td>', 'Nothing much going on here. Why have the focus be on the  blanket(?) instead of on the person? The light behind her head is really harsh.', '2007-01-10 00:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3203026, 449548, 69387, '<td valign="top">Maybe a tad too dark, but I love your subject and how nicely you captured his expression. Good work!</td>', 'Maybe a tad too dark, but I love your subject and how nicely you captured his expression. Good work!', '2007-01-10 00:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
