(3203389, 447875, 39674, '<td valign="top">Great shot, Nice light. The only thing I would have done is burned the background down so he really stood out, and if possible, I would have try to eliminate the car from the background.</td>', 'Great shot, Nice light. The only thing I would have done is burned the background down so he really stood out, and if possible, I would have try to eliminate the car from the background.', '2007-01-10 01:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
