(3203408, 449978, 19982, '<td valign="top">See the white line that separates his sleeve from his arm, or his shirt from his chest?  These "halos" are caused by too much sharpening.  It''s also evident  (but harder to explain) in his beard and even in the letters on his hat).  Anyway, the main thing is ... sharpen the image, but don''t over sharpen it.</td>', 'See the white line that separates his sleeve from his arm, or his shirt from his chest?  These "halos" are caused by too much sharpening.  It''s also evident  (but harder to explain) in his beard and even in the letters on his hat).  Anyway, the main thing is ... sharpen the image, but don''t over sharpen it.', '2007-01-10 01:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
