(3203420, 448744, 39674, '<td valign="top">Did you shoot this with a wide angle? You may want to try a short telephoto. It would look less distorted. Nice light on the model though. The highlight on the  back ground should be more toward the center of the frame, fading darker toward the edges.</td>', 'Did you shoot this with a wide angle? You may want to try a short telephoto. It would look less distorted. Nice light on the model though. The highlight on the  back ground should be more toward the center of the frame, fading darker toward the edges.', '2007-01-10 01:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
