(3203435, 450227, 34217, '<td valign="top">I would have liked it better without the wings.  I just think wings have been overdone in general.  I do have to say that at least your wings don''t have that really fake wal-mart look.  I think the face is a little over retouched but I know that dspers tend to like that.  Anyhow, I love the make up the frame and the facial expression.  Overall good job, I am very critical when it comes to kids since I photograph them for a living.  I hope you do well. 8</td>', 'I would have liked it better without the wings.  I just think wings have been overdone in general.  I do have to say that at least your wings don''t have that really fake wal-mart look.  I think the face is a little over retouched but I know that dspers tend to like that.  Anyhow, I love the make up the frame and the facial expression.  Overall good job, I am very critical when it comes to kids since I photograph them for a living.  I hope you do well. 8', '2007-01-10 01:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
