(3203475, 447278, 34217, '<td valign="top">looks over retouched, but the lines on the forehead really stand out since the rest of the skin looks fake.  The key to retouching is that it should be subtle.  This is not.  I don''t love the facial expression either, but I do recognize that the quality of the photo is lovely and the framing is wonderful.  I wish people would not go so overboard with the clone and bandaid tool.  If it was not done in photoshop was it neat image?  Anyhow next time ease up a bit, people don''t have perfect skin. 6</td>', 'looks over retouched, but the lines on the forehead really stand out since the rest of the skin looks fake.  The key to retouching is that it should be subtle.  This is not.  I don''t love the facial expression either, but I do recognize that the quality of the photo is lovely and the framing is wonderful.  I wish people would not go so overboard with the clone and bandaid tool.  If it was not done in photoshop was it neat image?  Anyhow next time ease up a bit, people don''t have perfect skin. 6', '2007-01-10 01:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
