(3203504, 449082, 34217, '<td valign="top">I love everything about this but the light.  I would have liked to see more of a highlight in the eyes.  However everything else about the photo is stunning.  I love love love the facial expression and the hair.  I could even argue that the darker eyes work with the photo, but I do love beautiful light.  So I think that a 9 in in order, really nice job!</td>', 'I love everything about this but the light.  I would have liked to see more of a highlight in the eyes.  However everything else about the photo is stunning.  I love love love the facial expression and the hair.  I could even argue that the darker eyes work with the photo, but I do love beautiful light.  So I think that a 9 in in order, really nice job!', '2007-01-10 01:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3203509, 448125, 19982, '<td valign="top">A little sharper focus on the eyes would get a higher vote from me.  Otherwise, I like the lighting and b&amp;w treatment.</td>', 'A little sharper focus on the eyes would get a higher vote from me.  Otherwise, I like the lighting and b&w treatment.', '2007-01-10 01:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3203512, 447207, 34938, '<td valign="top">I really like the jumper like that, and those eyes are stunningly beautiful...just lacks a little bit of sharpness and the lighting is a little too flat for me, but a lovely composition overall 7</td>', 'I really like the jumper like that, and those eyes are stunningly beautiful...just lacks a little bit of sharpness and the lighting is a little too flat for me, but a lovely composition overall 7', '2007-01-10 01:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
