(3203516, 447446, 67145, '<td valign="top">OMG .. far out, so REAL and very emotive .. its a terrible problem in these times ... my thoughts and prayers go out to anyone in this situation .. just know that its one of the most difficult things to break, but it can be done ... you''ve just gotta believe that you can do it!! ... =9</td>', 'OMG .. far out, so REAL and very emotive .. its a terrible problem in these times ... my thoughts and prayers go out to anyone in this situation .. just know that its one of the most difficult things to break, but it can be done ... you''ve just gotta believe that you can do it!! ... =9', '2007-01-10 01:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3203517, 450224, 34938, '<td valign="top">really interesting and quirky...I like the detail...very creative</td>', 'really interesting and quirky...I like the detail...very creative', '2007-01-10 01:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3203518, 450664, 15511, '<td valign="top">Well done, too bad about the DQ...</td>', 'Well done, too bad about the DQ...', '2007-01-10 01:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3203521, 448162, 61818, '<td valign="top">I like this as much as the one I already commented on that you posted in the forums.  Sorry but I really hate it when people post outtakes of something they''ve got in a challenge.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like this as much as the one I already commented on that you posted in the forums.  Sorry but I really hate it when people post outtakes of something they''ve got in a challenge.  Good luck.', '2007-01-10 01:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3203523, 448761, 19982, '<td valign="top">Yeah, cute kid.  A hair light would avoid having his head merge with the background.  But otherwise, I love his expression and the general lighting.  Nice b&amp;w treatment too.</td>', 'Yeah, cute kid.  A hair light would avoid having his head merge with the background.  But otherwise, I love his expression and the general lighting.  Nice b&w treatment too.', '2007-01-10 01:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3203525, 447645, 29591, '<td valign="top">love the hair, very sexy shot. IMHO the face has many highlights. She is gorgeous</td>', 'love the hair, very sexy shot. IMHO the face has many highlights. She is gorgeous', '2007-01-10 01:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3203526, 448964, 34217, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the high key works so well here.  Kids have great skin and usually high key will make adult skin look better.  Not that you can''t photo children in high key.  Because your lighting down on her face the depth of light is dropping off a bit and her chin and lower lip has some tone coming in.  This makes me feel like your light is just uneven  and over exposed not high key.  Even so I love the faming and the expression 7</td>', 'I don''t think the high key works so well here.  Kids have great skin and usually high key will make adult skin look better.  Not that you can''t photo children in high key.  Because your lighting down on her face the depth of light is dropping off a bit and her chin and lower lip has some tone coming in.  This makes me feel like your light is just uneven  and over exposed not high key.  Even so I love the faming and the expression 7', '2007-01-10 01:29:32.000000', NULL, 1);
