(3203552, 448693, 39674, '<td valign="top">nice subject and background. I would have avoided on-camera flash though. It really takes away from the feel.</td>', 'nice subject and background. I would have avoided on-camera flash though. It really takes away from the feel.', '2007-01-10 01:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3203553, 449819, 34217, '<td valign="top">kids don''t need this much retouching!!!  They have beautiful skin.  This little one looks fake!  That is not always a good thing.  If you knew you were going to retouch this much I would have changed the wardrobe, it does not fit the doll skin look.  She should look like a kid not plastic!  Now that I am done having a fit, the facial expression is very nice and the hair is pretty.  I don''t love the framing, but it is not bad.  6</td>', 'kids don''t need this much retouching!!!  They have beautiful skin.  This little one looks fake!  That is not always a good thing.  If you knew you were going to retouch this much I would have changed the wardrobe, it does not fit the doll skin look.  She should look like a kid not plastic!  Now that I am done having a fit, the facial expression is very nice and the hair is pretty.  I don''t love the framing, but it is not bad.  6', '2007-01-10 01:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3203554, 450791, 67145, '<td valign="top">yeah ... great shot ... love the expression, the tones and contrasts ...</td>', 'yeah ... great shot ... love the expression, the tones and contrasts ...', '2007-01-10 01:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3203555, 450019, 62277, '<td valign="top">more contemplation than the once supposedly concentrating..</td>', 'more contemplation than the once supposedly concentrating..', '2007-01-10 01:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
