(3203585, 448939, 34217, '<td valign="top">love it.  Believe it or not I have seen this done a lot.  I went to brooks institute of photography and a lot of the students there did photos with this point of view.  I do think the dcp folks will like it.</td>', 'love it.  Believe it or not I have seen this done a lot.  I went to brooks institute of photography and a lot of the students there did photos with this point of view.  I do think the dcp folks will like it.', '2007-01-10 01:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
