(3203617, 450587, 39674, '<td valign="top">I would avoid wide angle and on camera flash. Go for short telephoto and window light, or bouncing the flash off a wall.</td>', 'I would avoid wide angle and on camera flash. Go for short telephoto and window light, or bouncing the flash off a wall.', '2007-01-10 01:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
