(3203632, 447174, 62277, '<td valign="top">one of the few over-exposed shots that actually work for me. glasses contrast really well here</td>', 'one of the few over-exposed shots that actually work for me. glasses contrast really well here', '2007-01-10 01:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3203636, 450664, 34217, '<td valign="top">I am usually a fan of nudes, but I don''t love this one.  I really like pretty nudes, she seems angry, not sexy and I don''t love the crop.  I do like the dramatic light, but it still doesn''t do much for me.  I am also female, so I like to seem something artistic in the nudes, I am not seeing it here.  I am sure that males see it differetly. 7</td>', 'I am usually a fan of nudes, but I don''t love this one.  I really like pretty nudes, she seems angry, not sexy and I don''t love the crop.  I do like the dramatic light, but it still doesn''t do much for me.  I am also female, so I like to seem something artistic in the nudes, I am not seeing it here.  I am sure that males see it differetly. 7', '2007-01-10 01:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3203639, 450664, 62277, '<td valign="top">the lighting contrasts really well.. a fine example of the use of light to create shadow. what we don''t see is just as sexy as what we do..</td>', 'the lighting contrasts really well.. a fine example of the use of light to create shadow. what we don''t see is just as sexy as what we do..', '2007-01-10 01:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
