(3204000, 449985, 22689, '<td valign="top">That''s a nice smile ! What a beautiful woman !<br/>After viewing so many portraits , I really appreciate this one , I was a bit tired of unnatural poses , fake looks and flat black&amp;white tones.<br/>I love the expression , the shining smile (not only the mouth , it''s visible in the eyes too), the good lighting , contrast and focus.<br/>I maybe would have preferred the white of the yes a bit whiter and slightlyless sharpening in the face.<br/>my vote : 9</td>', 'That''s a nice smile ! What a beautiful woman !After viewing so many portraits , I really appreciate this one , I was a bit tired of unnatural poses , fake looks and flat black&white tones.I love the expression , the shining smile (not only the mouth , it''s visible in the eyes too), the good lighting , contrast and focus.I maybe would have preferred the white of the yes a bit whiter and slightlyless sharpening in the face.my vote : 9', '2007-01-10 03:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
