(3204690, 450863, 68197, '<td valign="top">The skin tones seems a bit washed out - too white - on my screen, so missing a soft skin texture. I like the expression and the top-down angle!</td>', 'The skin tones seems a bit washed out - too white - on my screen, so missing a soft skin texture. I like the expression and the top-down angle!', '2007-01-10 08:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204691, 449629, 53147, '<td valign="top">I will comment here before this most likely gets dqed. I like the dyptich setup and its an interesting pose. The b&amp;w conversion is done well also. Look slike you have a little bit of halo action going on around your border. It might have been intentional but it look smore like you did a big final sharpen after you had completed your stroke. I try to do my stroke the final thing to prevent the USM halo effect. Again - this is an interesting image - the contrast of the sides focus is a good take. I am gonna vote a 7 on this and hope that it is still around come the end of the week when I do my final bump ups.</td>', 'I will comment here before this most likely gets dqed. I like the dyptich setup and its an interesting pose. The b&w conversion is done well also. Look slike you have a little bit of halo action going on around your border. It might have been intentional but it look smore like you did a big final sharpen after you had completed your stroke. I try to do my stroke the final thing to prevent the USM halo effect. Again - this is an interesting image - the contrast of the sides focus is a good take. I am gonna vote a 7 on this and hope that it is still around come the end of the week when I do my final bump ups.', '2007-01-10 08:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204695, 450765, 68197, '<td valign="top">Some may disagree but I like the "half moon" lighting effect!</td>', 'Some may disagree but I like the "half moon" lighting effect!', '2007-01-10 08:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
