(3204706, 450842, 19982, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp focus on the eyes.  Lovely lighting and b&amp;w treatment.  Nice out of focus, non-distracting background.  Cute pose.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice sharp focus on the eyes.  Lovely lighting and b&w treatment.  Nice out of focus, non-distracting background.  Cute pose.  Well done.', '2007-01-10 08:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204709, 449196, 19982, '<td valign="top">A little more light on the eyes, and sharper focus on the eyes would get a higher vote from me.</td>', 'A little more light on the eyes, and sharper focus on the eyes would get a higher vote from me.', '2007-01-10 08:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204712, 449570, 60073, '<td valign="top">IT would have been a nicer picture without the water/steam.  Good Photo</td>', 'IT would have been a nicer picture without the water/steam.  Good Photo', '2007-01-10 08:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204715, 449664, 19982, '<td valign="top">It appears that the light was too strong, or the contrast was bumped too much in post... the light on the front of the face is blown out (i.e. there is no detail left in the nose, the cheek, the forehead).  Contrast that with how much detail is on her shoulders and chest and you can see the it''s been blown.  This was probably caused by having the light source too close to her head.  Very close.  Since light diminishes with the square of the distance, it would have to be very close in order to be too strong on the face, which is only inches higher than her chest.</td>', 'It appears that the light was too strong, or the contrast was bumped too much in post... the light on the front of the face is blown out (i.e. there is no detail left in the nose, the cheek, the forehead).  Contrast that with how much detail is on her shoulders and chest and you can see the it''s been blown.  This was probably caused by having the light source too close to her head.  Very close.  Since light diminishes with the square of the distance, it would have to be very close in order to be too strong on the face, which is only inches higher than her chest.', '2007-01-10 08:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204719, 450247, 60073, '<td valign="top">wish there was more lighting in the back so you can see the hair</td>', 'wish there was more lighting in the back so you can see the hair', '2007-01-10 08:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204722, 450333, 60073, '<td valign="top">too dark on the left side..</td>', 'too dark on the left side..', '2007-01-10 08:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
