(3205628, 449956, 57421, '<td valign="top">nice (lighting, pose, model etc.) My issue if I may is with the hair in front of her right eye. Once I noticed it, I couldn''t stop but being bugged by it. As I was trying to understand why (I''m not against portraits where you hide one eye in the shadow or under hair), I think the problem here is that I see the outer half of the eye. I would have prefered to have her eye fully hiden, while here the half visible part is dragging my attention.</td>', 'nice (lighting, pose, model etc.) My issue if I may is with the hair in front of her right eye. Once I noticed it, I couldn''t stop but being bugged by it. As I was trying to understand why (I''m not against portraits where you hide one eye in the shadow or under hair), I think the problem here is that I see the outer half of the eye. I would have prefered to have her eye fully hiden, while here the half visible part is dragging my attention.', '2007-01-10 10:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
