(3205734, 449117, 13772, '<td valign="top">I like the soft tones and overall feeling of this pic. I wish I could see her eyes but I know it is an outside photo. Still this is a great shot and should do well. Good luck!</td>', 'I like the soft tones and overall feeling of this pic. I wish I could see her eyes but I know it is an outside photo. Still this is a great shot and should do well. Good luck!', '2007-01-10 11:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
