(3205750, 450545, 57421, '<td valign="top">nice portrait, good lighting and character. The hand is adding a nice touch of originality. The pattern of the shirt is a bit distracting though. I would prefer the picture with a more neutral color and a closer crop. Good job still.</td>', 'nice portrait, good lighting and character. The hand is adding a nice touch of originality. The pattern of the shirt is a bit distracting though. I would prefer the picture with a more neutral color and a closer crop. Good job still.', '2007-01-10 11:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205751, 450808, 60614, '<td valign="top">This is an absolutely wonderful B/W photo.  I love the fact it is not the typical beautiful woman with flawless skin and it is not a really weathered face.  You are somewhere in between which is a pleasant change.  The composition is very nice and I like how the hair frames your face.  You do look shy so the title is perfect.  The focus on the one eye is a nice crisp focus.  Probably should have the other eye/face in focus too but it is not distracting and does not take away from the photo.  As for the lighting <b>WOW!</b>  It really makes your hair stand out from the black background.  Great job and I hope you do well.</td>', 'This is an absolutely wonderful B/W photo.  I love the fact it is not the typical beautiful woman with flawless skin and it is not a really weathered face.  You are somewhere in between which is a pleasant change.  The composition is very nice and I like how the hair frames your face.  You do look shy so the title is perfect.  The focus on the one eye is a nice crisp focus.  Probably should have the other eye/face in focus too but it is not distracting and does not take away from the photo.  As for the lighting WOW!  It really makes your hair stand out from the black background.  Great job and I hope you do well.', '2007-01-10 11:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
