(3206699, 449841, 12200, '<td valign="top">It looks to me like a higher crop on the bottom would have made this a more flattering portrait of the subject, without losing the nice effect of those railroad tracks in the background. I love the lighting, though.</td>', 'It looks to me like a higher crop on the bottom would have made this a more flattering portrait of the subject, without losing the nice effect of those railroad tracks in the background. I love the lighting, though.', '2007-01-10 13:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206704, 449295, 71330, '<td valign="top">Black and white!</td>', 'Black and white!', '2007-01-10 13:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206707, 447223, 46819, '<td valign="top">Well think this is great =) the ocntrast works really effectively here and your eyes are perfectly outlined and clear, especially the irises which look dazzling. What''s great is the pattern on your cheek brings the slightly faded out mouth back into the photo and works well to bring the attention to the image as a whole. Very nicely done, one of the best I''ve seen you do. I''m sure you''ll do better then me!  xxx</td>', 'Well think this is great =) the ocntrast works really effectively here and your eyes are perfectly outlined and clear, especially the irises which look dazzling. What''s great is the pattern on your cheek brings the slightly faded out mouth back into the photo and works well to bring the attention to the image as a whole. Very nicely done, one of the best I''ve seen you do. I''m sure you''ll do better then me!  xxx', '2007-01-10 14:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206708, 450830, 3459, '<td valign="top">10!</td>', '10!', '2007-01-10 14:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206715, 449570, 71330, '<td valign="top">Would have like the hand also not to be so much visible</td>', 'Would have like the hand also not to be so much visible', '2007-01-10 14:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206716, 449435, 12200, '<td valign="top">A bit blurry on the facial details (esp. the the nose and eyes)...and it doesn''t quite look intentional. One approach I use to help make it look intentional is to apply a "diffuse" filter to the entire image. Otherwise, though, this is a very flattering image. Thanks for sharing it!</td>', 'A bit blurry on the facial details (esp. the the nose and eyes)...and it doesn''t quite look intentional. One approach I use to help make it look intentional is to apply a "diffuse" filter to the entire image. Otherwise, though, this is a very flattering image. Thanks for sharing it!', '2007-01-10 14:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206725, 447174, 66515, '<td valign="top">Blown hightlights take away from this shot</td>', 'Blown hightlights take away from this shot', '2007-01-10 14:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206726, 450623, 12200, '<td valign="top">Very well executed composition here. My only complaint (and it''s a matter of artistic opinion, not photographic composition): the shadows feel TOO dark, especially in the eye. I rated this one a 7.</td>', 'Very well executed composition here. My only complaint (and it''s a matter of artistic opinion, not photographic composition): the shadows feel TOO dark, especially in the eye. I rated this one a 7.', '2007-01-10 14:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206727, 447226, 71330, '<td valign="top">Empty</td>', 'Empty', '2007-01-10 14:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206729, 447302, 44728, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, nice postprocess and crop!</td>', 'Gorgeous, nice postprocess and crop!', '2007-01-10 14:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206732, 450715, 44728, '<td valign="top">That''s more blue &amp; white too me!</td>', 'That''s more blue & white too me!', '2007-01-10 14:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206733, 450054, 71330, '<td valign="top">ok but too classical. Pause is not natural enough</td>', 'ok but too classical. Pause is not natural enough', '2007-01-10 14:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206734, 449761, 12200, '<td valign="top">Beautifully executed, and the post-processing really draws the focus squarely to the eyes.</td>', 'Beautifully executed, and the post-processing really draws the focus squarely to the eyes.', '2007-01-10 14:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206736, 449166, 71330, '<td valign="top">Like the transparent effect but no expression on the face</td>', 'Like the transparent effect but no expression on the face', '2007-01-10 14:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
