(3206748, 449095, 12200, '<td valign="top">Lovely idea and nice composition...but not as well-executed as it might have been. It''s a bit too grainy and ill-focused to persuade me.</td>', 'Lovely idea and nice composition...but not as well-executed as it might have been. It''s a bit too grainy and ill-focused to persuade me.', '2007-01-10 14:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
