(3206764, 450811, 49007, '<td valign="top">portrait<br/> <br/>noun<br/>1. 	a painting of a person''s face <br/>2. 	a word picture of a person''s appearance and character [syn: portrayal] <br/>3. 	any likeness of a person; "the photographer made excellent portraits" <br/> <br/>So you''re portraying yourself as a hand and 2 legs? ok.</td>', 'portrait noun1. 	a painting of a person''s face 2. 	a word picture of a person''s appearance and character [syn: portrayal] 3. 	any likeness of a person; "the photographer made excellent portraits"  So you''re portraying yourself as a hand and 2 legs? ok.', '2007-01-10 14:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
