(3206814, 447041, 49007, '<td valign="top">The way you processed the skin creeps me out to be blunt. The skin looks like plastic. No offense.</td>', 'The way you processed the skin creeps me out to be blunt. The skin looks like plastic. No offense.', '2007-01-10 14:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206816, 447485, 71268, '<td valign="top">Looks like "old school".</td>', 'Looks like "old school".', '2007-01-10 14:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206821, 450642, 71045, '<td valign="top">Good catchlights!  Skin seems to be more on the grey side, this could be boosed in photoshup&gt;curves, the hair also bends too much with the background....unless this was your intent?</td>', 'Good catchlights!  Skin seems to be more on the grey side, this could be boosed in photoshup>curves, the hair also bends too much with the background....unless this was your intent?', '2007-01-10 14:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206824, 447206, 12200, '<td valign="top">Sorry...I''ve looked at this one a couple times now and even with the wide berth for interpretive submissions, this one just DNMC for me because it''s neither in portrait orientation nor does it focus on a living subject (the title even says so). The photo is decently executed; it just cannot score well for me relative to the others in this challenge with so many superb submissions.</td>', 'Sorry...I''ve looked at this one a couple times now and even with the wide berth for interpretive submissions, this one just DNMC for me because it''s neither in portrait orientation nor does it focus on a living subject (the title even says so). The photo is decently executed; it just cannot score well for me relative to the others in this challenge with so many superb submissions.', '2007-01-10 14:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206825, 450657, 70187, '<td valign="top">I like the whole idea. The umbrella works well with the lady. But technically the composition is wrong and i feel it in the end result.. meaning: she looks to the left, you have the umbrella leaning to the left, yet you give no place to either of them. You have so much space to the right, why not move your granddaughter up to the right and as such give more space to the look, as well to the umbrella which is presently cut off.<br/> <br/>The lighting is spot on.. very nicely toned. <br/> <br/>I get the impression you really searched and found the right person for this challenge. Just that small detail of composition.. vote=6</td>', 'I like the whole idea. The umbrella works well with the lady. But technically the composition is wrong and i feel it in the end result.. meaning: she looks to the left, you have the umbrella leaning to the left, yet you give no place to either of them. You have so much space to the right, why not move your granddaughter up to the right and as such give more space to the look, as well to the umbrella which is presently cut off. The lighting is spot on.. very nicely toned.  I get the impression you really searched and found the right person for this challenge. Just that small detail of composition.. vote=6', '2007-01-10 14:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206826, 450753, 49007, '<td valign="top">The way you processed the skin and eyes creeps me out to be blunt. The skin looks like plastic and the eyes almost glow. No offense.</td>', 'The way you processed the skin and eyes creeps me out to be blunt. The skin looks like plastic and the eyes almost glow. No offense.', '2007-01-10 14:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206830, 450735, 49007, '<td valign="top">The way you processed the skin and eyes creeps me out to be blunt. The skin looks like plastic and the eyes almost glow. No offense.</td>', 'The way you processed the skin and eyes creeps me out to be blunt. The skin looks like plastic and the eyes almost glow. No offense.', '2007-01-10 14:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206834, 450659, 51613, '<td valign="top">Although I''m not crazy about the shadow on the swan''s face, I have to at least give credit for the title...</td>', 'Although I''m not crazy about the shadow on the swan''s face, I have to at least give credit for the title...', '2007-01-10 14:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206835, 450674, 12200, '<td valign="top">It''s a timeless expression on the subject''s face, but the lighting on the features makes this look slightly overexposed. I might try lightly burning the cheeks and chin regions to bring out those freckles, too.</td>', 'It''s a timeless expression on the subject''s face, but the lighting on the features makes this look slightly overexposed. I might try lightly burning the cheeks and chin regions to bring out those freckles, too.', '2007-01-10 14:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206836, 447221, 14211, '<td valign="top">he is soooo cute.</td>', 'he is soooo cute.', '2007-01-10 14:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206837, 448438, 71045, '<td valign="top">Ohhh I like the mood in this!  The grain adds to this, very nice!  Good composition.  Not sure if the focus is supposed to be on the person or the buildings though...seems they buildings are more in focus.</td>', 'Ohhh I like the mood in this!  The grain adds to this, very nice!  Good composition.  Not sure if the focus is supposed to be on the person or the buildings though...seems they buildings are more in focus.', '2007-01-10 14:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206839, 450225, 49007, '<td valign="top">Harsh flat lighting probably from on-camera flash. The way you processed the skin creeps me out to be blunt. The skin looks like plastic. No offense.</td>', 'Harsh flat lighting probably from on-camera flash. The way you processed the skin creeps me out to be blunt. The skin looks like plastic. No offense.', '2007-01-10 14:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206841, 448358, 12200, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and nice cropping. I would rate this one higher perhaps in another challenge, but among so many submissions of extremely high caliber, this one is just not the most original, so I rated it a 6.</td>', 'Beautiful composition and nice cropping. I would rate this one higher perhaps in another challenge, but among so many submissions of extremely high caliber, this one is just not the most original, so I rated it a 6.', '2007-01-10 14:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206848, 450750, 14620, '<td valign="top">Great outdoor portrait.  The composition is good, the setting is very nice, Good B&amp;W conversion.  And you kind of get a sense of who he is from this photo. 8</td>', 'Great outdoor portrait.  The composition is good, the setting is very nice, Good B&W conversion.  And you kind of get a sense of who he is from this photo. 8', '2007-01-10 14:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206852, 448535, 70187, '<td valign="top">Looks incredible pixelated.. and it doesn''t fit with his face (too little wrinkles,..)in my opinion (vote=4)</td>', 'Looks incredible pixelated.. and it doesn''t fit with his face (too little wrinkles,..)in my opinion (vote=4)', '2007-01-10 14:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206853, 449795, 49007, '<td valign="top">What''s the white line going through herleft eye?</td>', 'What''s the white line going through herleft eye?', '2007-01-10 14:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206858, 450472, 12200, '<td valign="top">Way too ill-focused and grainy, with too much contrast. It looks like this was shot with too little resolution; try setting your camera to record at a size much larger than what you actually need, because then resizing images for the web is possible without losing detail or adding "noise" like this. Also, had this been at a higher resolution, I think that some creative post-processing could have salvaged this image and made it a solid 5 or better.</td>', 'Way too ill-focused and grainy, with too much contrast. It looks like this was shot with too little resolution; try setting your camera to record at a size much larger than what you actually need, because then resizing images for the web is possible without losing detail or adding "noise" like this. Also, had this been at a higher resolution, I think that some creative post-processing could have salvaged this image and made it a solid 5 or better.', '2007-01-10 14:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206860, 449295, 51613, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t really meet the challenge...</td>', 'This doesn''t really meet the challenge...', '2007-01-10 14:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206864, 450715, 49007, '<td valign="top">Her eyes are GLOWING and SHARP while everything else is OOF. Too much blur.</td>', 'Her eyes are GLOWING and SHARP while everything else is OOF. Too much blur.', '2007-01-10 14:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206866, 450159, 64929, '<td valign="top">Great capture, but a little too cropped IMHO....might have had more impact with a close up of her face</td>', 'Great capture, but a little too cropped IMHO....might have had more impact with a close up of her face', '2007-01-10 14:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206869, 450674, 49007, '<td valign="top">The eyes are to sharp while the hair is out of focus. Looks like you got carried away with the blur.</td>', 'The eyes are to sharp while the hair is out of focus. Looks like you got carried away with the blur.', '2007-01-10 14:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206871, 450614, 49007, '<td valign="top">The way you processed the skin creeps me out to be blunt. The skin looks like plastic. No offense.</td>', 'The way you processed the skin creeps me out to be blunt. The skin looks like plastic. No offense.', '2007-01-10 14:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206874, 449266, 12200, '<td valign="top">It''s nice composition, but a bit blurry and without striking enough contrast to persuade me. I love the effect of the lights in the background, but at this close a focal range, I think the distract a bit from the subject. I would personally take my dodge tool, set the exposure really high, and lose all but the dog itself in this shot. That sort of high contrast, coupled with some sharpening edits, would make this more striking and original to me. 4 from me. Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'It''s nice composition, but a bit blurry and without striking enough contrast to persuade me. I love the effect of the lights in the background, but at this close a focal range, I think the distract a bit from the subject. I would personally take my dodge tool, set the exposure really high, and lose all but the dog itself in this shot. That sort of high contrast, coupled with some sharpening edits, would make this more striking and original to me. 4 from me. Good luck in the challenge!', '2007-01-10 14:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206877, 450715, 70187, '<td valign="top">On my screen this is blue-isch and not b/w. (vote=4)</td>', 'On my screen this is blue-isch and not b/w. (vote=4)', '2007-01-10 14:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206879, 450047, 49007, '<td valign="top">WAY oversharpened. His skin looks unnatural.</td>', 'WAY oversharpened. His skin looks unnatural.', '2007-01-10 14:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
