(3206956, 449235, 12200, '<td valign="top">Hmmm....this one is a real stretch on the challenge topic. I''m going to rate as though it''s a valid interpretation, though. I don''t like the hue of the colors in the flowers, and I think some saturation of that range of colors would greatly enhance this shot.</td>', 'Hmmm....this one is a real stretch on the challenge topic. I''m going to rate as though it''s a valid interpretation, though. I don''t like the hue of the colors in the flowers, and I think some saturation of that range of colors would greatly enhance this shot.', '2007-01-10 14:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
