(3206968, 450453, 70187, '<td valign="top">Nice look of Frosina, like the clothing, but the lighting is right in my opinion. The white in the eyes are darker than the highlights in the skin, which doesn''t seem right. This Grey in the eyes make the photo seem too dark, too negative which doesn''t fit the expression. vote=7</td>', 'Nice look of Frosina, like the clothing, but the lighting is right in my opinion. The white in the eyes are darker than the highlights in the skin, which doesn''t seem right. This Grey in the eyes make the photo seem too dark, too negative which doesn''t fit the expression. vote=7', '2007-01-10 14:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
