(3206981, 448485, 12200, '<td valign="top">The post-processing on this helps it tremendously, taking an otherwise mundane and mediocre snapshot and capturing the "mood" of the shot and creating a work of art. Very finely done. I''m having a little difficulty ascertaining whether the subject is smiling or crying, though...probably because the eyes are obscured by her hair. I find the ambiguity intriguing. 7 from me.</td>', 'The post-processing on this helps it tremendously, taking an otherwise mundane and mediocre snapshot and capturing the "mood" of the shot and creating a work of art. Very finely done. I''m having a little difficulty ascertaining whether the subject is smiling or crying, though...probably because the eyes are obscured by her hair. I find the ambiguity intriguing. 7 from me.', '2007-01-10 14:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
