(3207107, 447435, 68372, '<td valign="top">The focus is weak<br/>Too much shadows and not enough lighting<br/>Need more contrast to give it some punch.</td>', 'The focus is weakToo much shadows and not enough lightingNeed more contrast to give it some punch.', '2007-01-10 15:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207110, 450822, 52439, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic shot, really original and incredibly well executed.<br/>One of the best i''ve seen in this challenge so far.<br/>I love how the curvature of your neck follows the blade so closely.<br/>Stands out so well next to the ''standard'' shots, or poses should i say, in this challenge, breath of fresh air.<br/>9.</td>', 'What a fantastic shot, really original and incredibly well executed.One of the best i''ve seen in this challenge so far.I love how the curvature of your neck follows the blade so closely.Stands out so well next to the ''standard'' shots, or poses should i say, in this challenge, breath of fresh air.9.', '2007-01-10 15:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
