(3207139, 450190, 67489, '<td valign="top">Nice smile. I personally would have liked to see more of her head and less of her body. I find it looks odd having her head cut off at the top and side. The pic also looks a little purple. Maybe just my monitor though</td>', 'Nice smile. I personally would have liked to see more of her head and less of her body. I find it looks odd having her head cut off at the top and side. The pic also looks a little purple. Maybe just my monitor though', '2007-01-10 15:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
