(3207154, 448115, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good photo potential, but a few issues will probably drag your score down to the low 5s...<br/>All of the verticals and the horizon are tilted to the left (and not enough to appear intentional). DPCers are brutal on tilted horizons. I would have cropped just over the head to reduce that large area of white sky, and the B&amp;W conversion seems flat (like a straight desaturation). If you have Photoshop, try using Channel mixer for conversion with Green as the dominate channel. Any or all of these flaws could have been overcome with a strong expression from the model, but this girl just looks like she doesn''t want to be there, and there''s no apparent connection between her and the buses. Take a look at a cropped, straighter version with a channel mixer conversion and I think you''ll understand. ;-)</td>', 'Good photo potential, but a few issues will probably drag your score down to the low 5s...All of the verticals and the horizon are tilted to the left (and not enough to appear intentional). DPCers are brutal on tilted horizons. I would have cropped just over the head to reduce that large area of white sky, and the B&W conversion seems flat (like a straight desaturation). If you have Photoshop, try using Channel mixer for conversion with Green as the dominate channel. Any or all of these flaws could have been overcome with a strong expression from the model, but this girl just looks like she doesn''t want to be there, and there''s no apparent connection between her and the buses. Take a look at a cropped, straighter version with a channel mixer conversion and I think you''ll understand. ;-)', '2007-01-10 15:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207156, 450822, 43936, '<td valign="top">waw, that''s dangerous:) cool pic!</td>', 'waw, that''s dangerous:) cool pic!', '2007-01-10 15:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
