(3207349, 448409, 17203, '<td valign="top">A decent B&amp;W conversion and good composition. The biggest thing holding this entry back IMO is simply a lack of interest. There''s no context, story or compelling expression to draw in the viewer. It looks like you''ve used a somewhat wide angle lens too, which is rarely flattering. Try to aim for a focal length of 70-120mm for portraits, and give your subject some context to hold the viewer''s attention.</td>', 'A decent B&W conversion and good composition. The biggest thing holding this entry back IMO is simply a lack of interest. There''s no context, story or compelling expression to draw in the viewer. It looks like you''ve used a somewhat wide angle lens too, which is rarely flattering. Try to aim for a focal length of 70-120mm for portraits, and give your subject some context to hold the viewer''s attention.', '2007-01-10 15:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
