(3207471, 450295, 48954, '<td valign="top">Ok, there is a ragining debte about people''s voting habits at the moment, so i will attempt to give a detailed comment with my vote:<br/> <br/>I find that the shot is tooo overexposed. You lose facial details that normally make a person''s face interesting to look at. And the eyes are overly processed, and not only to they stand out too much, but they actually make me feel uncomfortable. However the capture of the smile is very effective and has to be taken into account. Also composition wise it;s quite good with the capture of the moment! 6 because it''s above average but overly processed.</td>', 'Ok, there is a ragining debte about people''s voting habits at the moment, so i will attempt to give a detailed comment with my vote: I find that the shot is tooo overexposed. You lose facial details that normally make a person''s face interesting to look at. And the eyes are overly processed, and not only to they stand out too much, but they actually make me feel uncomfortable. However the capture of the smile is very effective and has to be taken into account. Also composition wise it;s quite good with the capture of the moment! 6 because it''s above average but overly processed.', '2007-01-10 15:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
