(3207502, 450700, 48954, '<td valign="top">Ok, there is a ragining debte about people''s voting habits at the moment, so i will attempt to give a detailed comment with my vote:<br/> <br/>OK, so i find this to be an average shot. It''s a snap shot, without any controlled lighting etc. One does not always need excellent lighting but as a result your need something to that type of photo to make up for that lack of "wow" lighting, and this photo doesn''t seem to have it. Maye had it been an exceptional facial expression, or moment in time. This just seems to me like: hey Timmy, can i take a picture of you? oh open your mouth to make it cooler kinda thing. Also SIZE! Always take advantage of the 640 size! You can hurt when the pictures are much smaller. Final score: 5</td>', 'Ok, there is a ragining debte about people''s voting habits at the moment, so i will attempt to give a detailed comment with my vote: OK, so i find this to be an average shot. It''s a snap shot, without any controlled lighting etc. One does not always need excellent lighting but as a result your need something to that type of photo to make up for that lack of "wow" lighting, and this photo doesn''t seem to have it. Maye had it been an exceptional facial expression, or moment in time. This just seems to me like: hey Timmy, can i take a picture of you? oh open your mouth to make it cooler kinda thing. Also SIZE! Always take advantage of the 640 size! You can hurt when the pictures are much smaller. Final score: 5', '2007-01-10 15:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
