(3207734, 450214, 17203, '<td valign="top">A very good photo that will likely get clobbered for the color. The expression, texture and sharpness are all good, and there''s nothing wrong with little toning, but the strong brown hues shown here tend to overpower any sense of B&amp;W. The midtones seem a little flat, and I would suggesting cropping the top considerably to get the eyes out of the center, but the shot itself is quite strong. Nice job!</td>', 'A very good photo that will likely get clobbered for the color. The expression, texture and sharpness are all good, and there''s nothing wrong with little toning, but the strong brown hues shown here tend to overpower any sense of B&W. The midtones seem a little flat, and I would suggesting cropping the top considerably to get the eyes out of the center, but the shot itself is quite strong. Nice job!', '2007-01-10 16:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
