(3207819, 447033, 69537, '<td valign="top">If you cropped this tighter to show just the 5 faces, I will hand you a 10. <br/>But given the fact that the voters can only see 640 pixels and the cracked floor already took more than a quarter of it, I can not hardly see the emotion on the guys'' faces. Instead, I am giving a 7 for your B&amp;W processing.</td>', 'If you cropped this tighter to show just the 5 faces, I will hand you a 10. But given the fact that the voters can only see 640 pixels and the cracked floor already took more than a quarter of it, I can not hardly see the emotion on the guys'' faces. Instead, I am giving a 7 for your B&W processing.', '2007-01-10 16:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207823, 449883, 49007, '<td valign="top">Flat Lighting. Too much use of blur.</td>', 'Flat Lighting. Too much use of blur.', '2007-01-10 16:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207827, 449315, 49007, '<td valign="top">Flat lightin. On-camera flash?</td>', 'Flat lightin. On-camera flash?', '2007-01-10 16:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207831, 450737, 48954, '<td valign="top">Ok, there is a raging debte about people''s voting habits at the moment, so i will attempt to give a detailed comment with my vote:<br/> <br/>Fun photo, altough it''s been done before ;)<br/> <br/>Now you have noting on the left of the head or on its right, so why keep the wasted space? did you try a square crop? Also I see some funky black spots, or blobs around the head nad hand and that''s no good. The facial epression is good and it is to some extent an original photo. 6</td>', 'Ok, there is a raging debte about people''s voting habits at the moment, so i will attempt to give a detailed comment with my vote: Fun photo, altough it''s been done before ;) Now you have noting on the left of the head or on its right, so why keep the wasted space? did you try a square crop? Also I see some funky black spots, or blobs around the head nad hand and that''s no good. The facial epression is good and it is to some extent an original photo. 6', '2007-01-10 16:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207834, 449985, 49007, '<td valign="top">A little too much sharpening.</td>', 'A little too much sharpening.', '2007-01-10 16:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207835, 448967, 69537, '<td valign="top">I am not fond of portraits that have models making ugly faces. She is obviously really beautiful so why do that? Peace! =D</td>', 'I am not fond of portraits that have models making ugly faces. She is obviously really beautiful so why do that? Peace! =D', '2007-01-10 16:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207842, 447482, 24454, '<td valign="top">If you don''t win a ribbon with this, I will be sadly disappointed.   I have voted on a good strong number of them so far and there are none that are even in the same league as this one!    Easy 10!</td>', 'If you don''t win a ribbon with this, I will be sadly disappointed.   I have voted on a good strong number of them so far and there are none that are even in the same league as this one!    Easy 10!', '2007-01-10 16:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
