(3207857, 449554, 48954, '<td valign="top">Ok, there is a raging debte about people''s voting habits at the moment, so i will attempt to give a detailed comment with my vote:<br/> <br/>fist thing i notice: out of focus! Needs to be sharp here.<br/> <br/>Fun natural lighitng though and the capture is nice. good pose wit the trees on the branch. The photo should be bigger. akways take advantage of the 640 or 720 pixels! small photos don''t ever win or do very well. ever. because of the lack of focus i haveto bump down to 5 :( sry.</td>', 'Ok, there is a raging debte about people''s voting habits at the moment, so i will attempt to give a detailed comment with my vote: fist thing i notice: out of focus! Needs to be sharp here. Fun natural lighitng though and the capture is nice. good pose wit the trees on the branch. The photo should be bigger. akways take advantage of the 640 or 720 pixels! small photos don''t ever win or do very well. ever. because of the lack of focus i haveto bump down to 5 :( sry.', '2007-01-10 16:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207862, 450054, 3102, '<td valign="top">Man, she looks like Julia Roberts with blonde hair!</td>', 'Man, she looks like Julia Roberts with blonde hair!', '2007-01-10 16:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207866, 450842, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmy!!!  What refreshing beauty!   A refreshing adorable face for sure, photographed to absolute perfection, but also refreshing talent in this surprisingly weak challenge!  I will be disappointed if this one is not one of the top 3!   10!!  (only my 2nd one given today)</td>', 'Ohmy!!!  What refreshing beauty!   A refreshing adorable face for sure, photographed to absolute perfection, but also refreshing talent in this surprisingly weak challenge!  I will be disappointed if this one is not one of the top 3!   10!!  (only my 2nd one given today)', '2007-01-10 16:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
