(3207875, 450656, 48954, '<td valign="top">Ok, there is a raging debte about people''s voting habits at the moment, so i will attempt to give a detailed comment with my vote:<br/> <br/>this very good. nice original interpretation. problem? the tire! you cropped it off too much at the bottom. either should have zoomed out or cropped it tighter from the top. Great use of DOF. 7.</td>', 'Ok, there is a raging debte about people''s voting habits at the moment, so i will attempt to give a detailed comment with my vote: this very good. nice original interpretation. problem? the tire! you cropped it off too much at the bottom. either should have zoomed out or cropped it tighter from the top. Great use of DOF. 7.', '2007-01-10 16:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207879, 447278, 24454, '<td valign="top">Nice job!  Self portraits are hard to get really crisp and sharp, but you have done an excellent job -- and you would have had a hard time finding a more handsome model  :)    Good luck!   One of the strongest ones in this challenge in my opinion!</td>', 'Nice job!  Self portraits are hard to get really crisp and sharp, but you have done an excellent job -- and you would have had a hard time finding a more handsome model  :)    Good luck!   One of the strongest ones in this challenge in my opinion!', '2007-01-10 16:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207883, 449356, 69537, '<td valign="top">I wish you didn''t cut the head. 6</td>', 'I wish you didn''t cut the head. 6', '2007-01-10 16:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207885, 447464, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmygoodness!!!   I totally love the lack of vanity in this photo :)  Made me smile. . .AND. . .made me up the score a bit :)  Good luck!</td>', 'Ohmygoodness!!!   I totally love the lack of vanity in this photo :)  Made me smile. . .AND. . .made me up the score a bit :)  Good luck!', '2007-01-10 16:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
