(3207899, 450657, 48954, '<td valign="top">Ok, there is a raging debte about people''s voting habits at the moment, so i will attempt to give a detailed comment with my vote:<br/> <br/>Sharp. Good focus. Composition is not super interesting. I would have given it it a tighter crop. All in all, good quality image. Doesn''t stand out but it''s a quality shot. 7</td>', 'Ok, there is a raging debte about people''s voting habits at the moment, so i will attempt to give a detailed comment with my vote: Sharp. Good focus. Composition is not super interesting. I would have given it it a tighter crop. All in all, good quality image. Doesn''t stand out but it''s a quality shot. 7', '2007-01-10 16:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207906, 447567, 45519, '<td valign="top">The expression captured here really conveys a sense of angst and attitude, and it''s nicely processed (love the side light).  Only thing that keeps it from being stronger, IMO, is the amount of negative space to the right; cropping 2/3 of that would eliminate a mostly centered comp and strenghthen the facial expression/features.</td>', 'The expression captured here really conveys a sense of angst and attitude, and it''s nicely processed (love the side light).  Only thing that keeps it from being stronger, IMO, is the amount of negative space to the right; cropping 2/3 of that would eliminate a mostly centered comp and strenghthen the facial expression/features.', '2007-01-10 16:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207907, 449989, 69537, '<td valign="top">She''s beautiful but there''s too much glowing going on. 7.</td>', 'She''s beautiful but there''s too much glowing going on. 7.', '2007-01-10 16:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207919, 448439, 45519, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured candid ... that look, with the tear, really expresses a sense of emotion/sadness.  Too bad the eyes aren''t sharper/more in focus.</td>', 'Nicely captured candid ... that look, with the tear, really expresses a sense of emotion/sadness.  Too bad the eyes aren''t sharper/more in focus.', '2007-01-10 16:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
