(3207935, 447626, 45519, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Fantastic light and treatment.  Wasn''t sure what I was looking until reading the title and inpsecting the image further.  Not sure about how strongly this applies to a more literal definition of portraiture ... but a solid image nonetheless.</td>', 'Wow.  Fantastic light and treatment.  Wasn''t sure what I was looking until reading the title and inpsecting the image further.  Not sure about how strongly this applies to a more literal definition of portraiture ... but a solid image nonetheless.', '2007-01-10 16:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
