(3207971, 449058, 45519, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and captured.  I like how the cotton blossoms (?) mimic the subject''s eyes.  The b&amp;w treatment could be stronger, it''s a bit too green tinted for my liking and lacks the dynamic range I think this image could offer, but well done nonetheless.</td>', 'Nicely composed and captured.  I like how the cotton blossoms (?) mimic the subject''s eyes.  The b&w treatment could be stronger, it''s a bit too green tinted for my liking and lacks the dynamic range I think this image could offer, but well done nonetheless.', '2007-01-10 17:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207976, 447173, 24454, '<td valign="top">I like this one alot.  I love the sharp texture in his beard, and I love skin tones that show depth and texture.  Great job!   One of my favorites.</td>', 'I like this one alot.  I love the sharp texture in his beard, and I love skin tones that show depth and texture.  Great job!   One of my favorites.', '2007-01-10 17:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
