(3207995, 448964, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow, you did very well on your first high key!   High key is probably my favorite kind of portrait, and this one is beautiful!  Nice soft skin tones (without being tooooo soft).   Great clarity in the eyes.   I bet it won''t be your last high key, will it :)    This is one of my highest rated photos so far!   Good luck!  9</td>', 'Wow, you did very well on your first high key!   High key is probably my favorite kind of portrait, and this one is beautiful!  Nice soft skin tones (without being tooooo soft).   Great clarity in the eyes.   I bet it won''t be your last high key, will it :)    This is one of my highest rated photos so far!   Good luck!  9', '2007-01-10 17:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
