(3209290, 450830, 56961, '<td valign="top">This photograph could be beautiful- the closeness, the ringlets, the eyes, and the freckles are all compelling visually. But why the fog around the right corners and edge? If those areas had the same clarity, this picture would be breathtaking.</td>', 'This photograph could be beautiful- the closeness, the ringlets, the eyes, and the freckles are all compelling visually. But why the fog around the right corners and edge? If those areas had the same clarity, this picture would be breathtaking.', '2007-01-10 21:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
