(3209944, 450821, 34217, '<td valign="top">did you take a picture of a picture?  It looks like it, but maybe you did do all this in photoshop.  I am not going to vote on this one since I am not sure what you did here.</td>', 'did you take a picture of a picture?  It looks like it, but maybe you did do all this in photoshop.  I am not going to vote on this one since I am not sure what you did here.', '2007-01-10 23:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3209950, 447173, 34217, '<td valign="top">love the color :)</td>', 'love the color :)', '2007-01-10 23:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3209961, 448222, 34217, '<td valign="top">This is almost scary.  I am not a fan of selective color, but can appreciate it  if it is done well.  Her eyes are way to saturated.  You should had desaturated a little instead of going the other way.  It should be reall soft not scary.  The rest of the portrait is pretty but I have a hard time seeing anything else but those eyes.</td>', 'This is almost scary.  I am not a fan of selective color, but can appreciate it  if it is done well.  Her eyes are way to saturated.  You should had desaturated a little instead of going the other way.  It should be reall soft not scary.  The rest of the portrait is pretty but I have a hard time seeing anything else but those eyes.', '2007-01-10 23:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3209970, 448813, 34217, '<td valign="top">Your "karsh" light is to hot.  Bring it down a few stops.  I like about a one stop different or sometimes less.  There is something to be said for having a really subtle side light.  Also it usually works better if it does not hit the nose.  I love everything else about the photo 8</td>', 'Your "karsh" light is to hot.  Bring it down a few stops.  I like about a one stop different or sometimes less.  There is something to be said for having a really subtle side light.  Also it usually works better if it does not hit the nose.  I love everything else about the photo 8', '2007-01-10 23:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3209973, 448568, 34217, '<td valign="top">stunning!</td>', 'stunning!', '2007-01-10 23:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
