(3210398, 450737, 60770, '<td valign="top">I think a square crop of this image might reduce the awkward space on the sides. Very entertaining shot though.</td>', 'I think a square crop of this image might reduce the awkward space on the sides. Very entertaining shot though.', '2007-01-11 01:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
