(3210488, 449957, 70187, '<td valign="top">Looks like sepia on my screen. I do like the portrait though: nice light, nice expression and good composition.. still sepia not b/w. vote=4</td>', 'Looks like sepia on my screen. I do like the portrait though: nice light, nice expression and good composition.. still sepia not b/w. vote=4', '2007-01-11 01:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
