(3210527, 450019, 71392, '<td valign="top">that wisp of hair over her eye is unfortunate. It makes her look like she is dead instead of contemplating. otherwise great shot and model. 6</td>', 'that wisp of hair over her eye is unfortunate. It makes her look like she is dead instead of contemplating. otherwise great shot and model. 6', '2007-01-11 02:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3210528, 449697, 66201, '<td valign="top">Love the spontaneous action and little people busy-ness. Natural and real. Great clarity and contrasts. :-) Good luck with this entry.</td>', 'Love the spontaneous action and little people busy-ness. Natural and real. Great clarity and contrasts. :-) Good luck with this entry.', '2007-01-11 02:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3210533, 450716, 71392, '<td valign="top">subject is uncomfortable makes the viewer uncomfortable too, which I don''t think is the intention of this picture. not appropiate for B+W = 5</td>', 'subject is uncomfortable makes the viewer uncomfortable too, which I don''t think is the intention of this picture. not appropiate for B+W = 5', '2007-01-11 02:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
