(3212567, 448586, 71392, '<td valign="top">I hate to give an 8 to a non person portrait, (specially a dog!) but this one deserves it. Superbly executed.</td>', 'I hate to give an 8 to a non person portrait, (specially a dog!) but this one deserves it. Superbly executed.', '2007-01-11 13:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3212571, 450467, 71392, '<td valign="top">Interesting. After seeing so many portraits with a lot if not excessive shallow DoF I encounter this one which is completely the opposite. The result is striking. As a personal portrait I think it should work wonderfully, however I am not too sure if it appeals generally. The hand and background seems too distracting, the expression is not clear in its emotional effect. Feels slightly posed, maybe... In conclusion, an out of the ordinary picture that stands out from the rest - this means an 8 maybe 9 after looking all.</td>', 'Interesting. After seeing so many portraits with a lot if not excessive shallow DoF I encounter this one which is completely the opposite. The result is striking. As a personal portrait I think it should work wonderfully, however I am not too sure if it appeals generally. The hand and background seems too distracting, the expression is not clear in its emotional effect. Feels slightly posed, maybe... In conclusion, an out of the ordinary picture that stands out from the rest - this means an 8 maybe 9 after looking all.', '2007-01-11 13:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3212574, 450771, 71392, '<td valign="top">Lipstick incomplete? a bit too grainy? 7</td>', 'Lipstick incomplete? a bit too grainy? 7', '2007-01-11 13:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
