(3212936, 449978, 70187, '<td valign="top">I very much like the idea. A laptop on the background and a person that is looking away wearing a geek-sign: all very complementary elements. To me personally i feel you could have maybe placed them better. He looks away from us, which fits the geek part, but he also looks away from the laptop, which doesn''t fit. Maybe placing the laptop to the left of him (from our point of view) would fit more in the story. vote=6</td>', 'I very much like the idea. A laptop on the background and a person that is looking away wearing a geek-sign: all very complementary elements. To me personally i feel you could have maybe placed them better. He looks away from us, which fits the geek part, but he also looks away from the laptop, which doesn''t fit. Maybe placing the laptop to the left of him (from our point of view) would fit more in the story. vote=6', '2007-01-11 14:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
