(3213710, 449667, 71857, '<td valign="top">great lighting and contrast on the face. My one complaint is that your light source makes the water look opaque and white...or were you dripping milk?</td>', 'great lighting and contrast on the face. My one complaint is that your light source makes the water look opaque and white...or were you dripping milk?', '2007-01-11 17:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
