(3214910, 450575, 28359, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 3 on this shot. Imo not a portrait more of a candid shot. appears off focus to the left. The b&amp;w processing looks good. Just my opinion.</td>', 'I gave you a 3 on this shot. Imo not a portrait more of a candid shot. appears off focus to the left. The b&w processing looks good. Just my opinion.', '2007-01-11 22:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
