(3214921, 450540, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is a cute pose! It might improve the shot to get rid of the flash and instead take these two wonderful boys outside under an overcast sky--or use the flas outside where it won''t cast that shadow on the wall. Good luck!</td>', 'This is a cute pose! It might improve the shot to get rid of the flash and instead take these two wonderful boys outside under an overcast sky--or use the flas outside where it won''t cast that shadow on the wall. Good luck!', '2007-01-11 22:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214923, 450054, 6870, '<td valign="top">Pretty gal! I like the high key feel to this.</td>', 'Pretty gal! I like the high key feel to this.', '2007-01-11 22:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214925, 449548, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, rich tones and expression!</td>', 'Wonderful, rich tones and expression!', '2007-01-11 22:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214926, 448892, 19982, '<td valign="top">Ela é Brasileira?  <br/> <br/>I love the lighting, the soft b&amp;w tones, the use of both the negative space and the leading lines and the crop.  Well done!</td>', 'Ela é Brasileira?   I love the lighting, the soft b&w tones, the use of both the negative space and the leading lines and the crop.  Well done!', '2007-01-11 22:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214928, 449550, 19982, '<td valign="top">As with most potraits, I prefer to see the eyes more in focus than any other part of the body....  unless you''re a dentist showing off your dental work.</td>', 'As with most potraits, I prefer to see the eyes more in focus than any other part of the body....  unless you''re a dentist showing off your dental work.', '2007-01-11 22:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214929, 448787, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is such a cute gal! I like the pose and expression, too. You may want to experiment with adding some contrast, or fiddling with your mid-tone levels to add some richness to the shot. Good luck!</td>', 'This is such a cute gal! I like the pose and expression, too. You may want to experiment with adding some contrast, or fiddling with your mid-tone levels to add some richness to the shot. Good luck!', '2007-01-11 22:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214930, 447611, 66602, '<td valign="top">very creative, striking image</td>', 'very creative, striking image', '2007-01-11 22:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214933, 449985, 19982, '<td valign="top">Very pretty young lady and well lit, well posed, and cropped.  I''d suggest softening (without pasticizing) her skin just a bit.  Still, giving it fairly high marks.</td>', 'Very pretty young lady and well lit, well posed, and cropped.  I''d suggest softening (without pasticizing) her skin just a bit.  Still, giving it fairly high marks.', '2007-01-11 22:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214934, 448620, 6870, '<td valign="top">NIce lighting, pose and expression. You might try sharpening a little to give it some umph.</td>', 'NIce lighting, pose and expression. You might try sharpening a little to give it some umph.', '2007-01-11 22:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214938, 447875, 6870, '<td valign="top">Some dude! Very nice, and tricky, tones here! 8</td>', 'Some dude! Very nice, and tricky, tones here! 8', '2007-01-11 22:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214940, 449435, 19982, '<td valign="top">Gimme at least one eye to look at ... both eyes are hidden, either by the bridge of her nose or her hair.  The shadow her hair is throwing on her cheek is a little distracting as well.</td>', 'Gimme at least one eye to look at ... both eyes are hidden, either by the bridge of her nose or her hair.  The shadow her hair is throwing on her cheek is a little distracting as well.', '2007-01-11 22:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214948, 450482, 66602, '<td valign="top">like the use of the hair and the great focus (8)</td>', 'like the use of the hair and the great focus (8)', '2007-01-11 22:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214950, 450563, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is easy to dismiss as an average shot, but I feel that your use of tones, his expression, the slight tilt, and the bleak framing create a really wonderful, but subtle artistic concept and emotional portrait of this fellow. 8</td>', 'This is easy to dismiss as an average shot, but I feel that your use of tones, his expression, the slight tilt, and the bleak framing create a really wonderful, but subtle artistic concept and emotional portrait of this fellow. 8', '2007-01-11 22:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214952, 450133, 19982, '<td valign="top">Very pretty lady with soft lovely light washing across her face.  I like the b&amp;w toning as well.  Good job!</td>', 'Very pretty lady with soft lovely light washing across her face.  I like the b&w toning as well.  Good job!', '2007-01-11 22:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214955, 448376, 2857, '<td valign="top">you get bonus points for a funny face.</td>', 'you get bonus points for a funny face.', '2007-01-11 22:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214962, 448535, 2857, '<td valign="top">overprocessed</td>', 'overprocessed', '2007-01-11 22:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214964, 450732, 19982, '<td valign="top">Wow, it doesn''t look like it was dark outside ... but look at the size of his pupils.  It''s as if you took the shot in the dead of night.  In any case, I''d like to see a little more of a catch light in his eyes to liven up the eyes.</td>', 'Wow, it doesn''t look like it was dark outside ... but look at the size of his pupils.  It''s as if you took the shot in the dead of night.  In any case, I''d like to see a little more of a catch light in his eyes to liven up the eyes.', '2007-01-11 22:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214966, 448509, 19982, '<td valign="top">Very pretty young lady.  I like the lighting and the b&amp;w toning.  Well done.</td>', 'Very pretty young lady.  I like the lighting and the b&w toning.  Well done.', '2007-01-11 22:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214969, 448438, 6870, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a bit of a cliche, but I really like your handling of this classic "pensive and looking out the window" shot. The grain works for me, and the positioning and depth of field are really marvelous. I like how the depth of field shows us outside so clearly--and yet there''s really nothing amazing to see, so it''s a wonderful red herring that adds interest and meaning to the shot. 8</td>', 'Perhaps a bit of a cliche, but I really like your handling of this classic "pensive and looking out the window" shot. The grain works for me, and the positioning and depth of field are really marvelous. I like how the depth of field shows us outside so clearly--and yet there''s really nothing amazing to see, so it''s a wonderful red herring that adds interest and meaning to the shot. 8', '2007-01-11 22:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214972, 448533, 64387, '<td valign="top">I Really can''t see what it is..  The quality of the image is simply to low, to see any detail..</td>', 'I Really can''t see what it is..  The quality of the image is simply to low, to see any detail..', '2007-01-11 22:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214974, 450684, 19982, '<td valign="top">I generally prefer that the eyes be the sharpest point of any portrait. In this case, it looks as if you focused on his nostrils.</td>', 'I generally prefer that the eyes be the sharpest point of any portrait. In this case, it looks as if you focused on his nostrils.', '2007-01-11 22:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214976, 448162, 6870, '<td valign="top">Alien and strange. I like the deep tones and bizarre softness of this image. You are kind of creating your own rules here, but you play by them very effectively. 9 (whoa-9?)</td>', 'Alien and strange. I like the deep tones and bizarre softness of this image. You are kind of creating your own rules here, but you play by them very effectively. 9 (whoa-9?)', '2007-01-11 22:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214978, 448588, 10768, '<td valign="top">Cute shot of cute kids, but I find the background a bit distracting.</td>', 'Cute shot of cute kids, but I find the background a bit distracting.', '2007-01-11 22:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214985, 448140, 19982, '<td valign="top">Okay, it''s interesting but....  as a "protrait" I would dearly love to get a look at her face.</td>', 'Okay, it''s interesting but....  as a "protrait" I would dearly love to get a look at her face.', '2007-01-11 22:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214991, 448977, 19982, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp eyes!  Love the lighting, angle, b&amp;w toning.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice sharp eyes!  Love the lighting, angle, b&w toning.  Well done.', '2007-01-11 22:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214996, 447207, 19982, '<td valign="top">Wish the eyes were in sharper focus... but otherwise, I like the lighting and b&amp;w toning.</td>', 'Wish the eyes were in sharper focus... but otherwise, I like the lighting and b&w toning.', '2007-01-11 22:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214997, 450644, 10768, '<td valign="top">Good tonal range of b&amp;w''s and just the right amount of sharpening.  Interesting composition.  Well done!</td>', 'Good tonal range of b&w''s and just the right amount of sharpening.  Interesting composition.  Well done!', '2007-01-11 22:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3215000, 450659, 19982, '<td valign="top">Most "portraits" deal mainly with the face (human or otherwise).  In this case, the face of the swan is nearly invisible which reduces is charm for me.</td>', 'Most "portraits" deal mainly with the face (human or otherwise).  In this case, the face of the swan is nearly invisible which reduces is charm for me.', '2007-01-11 22:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3215008, 448805, 19982, '<td valign="top">Most portraits deal with the face (human or otherwise).  So for me the ball just isn''t working as a "portrait" for me.  Sorry.</td>', 'Most portraits deal with the face (human or otherwise).  So for me the ball just isn''t working as a "portrait" for me.  Sorry.', '2007-01-11 22:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3215018, 448690, 19982, '<td valign="top">Dang.... for me I generally consider a portrait to be an image that includes the face (human or otherwise).  But this image, I love it and still feel that it in some ways meets the challenge.  What a way to force me to rethink things!</td>', 'Dang.... for me I generally consider a portrait to be an image that includes the face (human or otherwise).  But this image, I love it and still feel that it in some ways meets the challenge.  What a way to force me to rethink things!', '2007-01-11 22:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3215048, 450585, 19982, '<td valign="top">Man, it just doesn''t fit my definition of a "portrait".  Too far away, too many other distracting things to look at.  If you didn''t mention fiddler, I would have suspect I was suppose to look at the closest guy (the one on the right walking away).  I would never have even noticed the fiddler (or figured out that he had an instrument in his hands).</td>', 'Man, it just doesn''t fit my definition of a "portrait".  Too far away, too many other distracting things to look at.  If you didn''t mention fiddler, I would have suspect I was suppose to look at the closest guy (the one on the right walking away).  I would never have even noticed the fiddler (or figured out that he had an instrument in his hands).', '2007-01-11 22:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3215051, 447464, 19982, '<td valign="top">It would be *so* funny if this ribboned and landed on the front page for a week!!!  :-)</td>', 'It would be *so* funny if this ribboned and landed on the front page for a week!!!  :-)', '2007-01-11 22:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3215057, 447633, 28359, '<td valign="top">I like the grain, maybe a little to much. 5 on your shot, would be 6 or 7 with a little less grain in the hands and face....ace</td>', 'I like the grain, maybe a little to much. 5 on your shot, would be 6 or 7 with a little less grain in the hands and face....ace', '2007-01-11 22:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3215062, 450771, 19982, '<td valign="top">Okay, I give low votes to just about every "half face" shot I see.  I''m just not a fan of cropping half a face off.  That said ... I *do* like her make up.  That, and the sharp focus on her eyes has made this image stand out for me.  Well done.</td>', 'Okay, I give low votes to just about every "half face" shot I see.  I''m just not a fan of cropping half a face off.  That said ... I *do* like her make up.  That, and the sharp focus on her eyes has made this image stand out for me.  Well done.', '2007-01-11 22:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3215067, 450627, 19982, '<td valign="top">The lighting in this "portrait" doesn''t work if it is to be a "family" portrait.  The way it is lit, all the attention goes on the girl in front, with some attention on the dad, and the mom being an after thought.</td>', 'The lighting in this "portrait" doesn''t work if it is to be a "family" portrait.  The way it is lit, all the attention goes on the girl in front, with some attention on the dad, and the mom being an after thought.', '2007-01-11 22:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3215069, 450727, 19982, '<td valign="top">For "portraits", I prefer to see the eyes...</td>', 'For "portraits", I prefer to see the eyes...', '2007-01-11 22:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3215074, 449235, 28359, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, the selective desat in my imo takes this shot out the the competion. 4</td>', 'I like the idea, the selective desat in my imo takes this shot out the the competion. 4', '2007-01-11 22:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3215080, 448484, 10768, '<td valign="top">Nice tonal range of b&amp;w''s Good sharpening.  Well done!</td>', 'Nice tonal range of b&w''s Good sharpening.  Well done!', '2007-01-11 22:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3215088, 450344, 19982, '<td valign="top">Is it really him?  Or a look-alike or wax dummy?  You''ve got me intrigued.  Regardless, I think the b&amp;w conversion was done well and I love the angles in this image.  Well done.</td>', 'Is it really him?  Or a look-alike or wax dummy?  You''ve got me intrigued.  Regardless, I think the b&w conversion was done well and I love the angles in this image.  Well done.', '2007-01-11 22:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3215089, 450615, 70293, '<td valign="top">Incredible depth. she looks as though she''s coming out of the computer.</td>', 'Incredible depth. she looks as though she''s coming out of the computer.', '2007-01-11 22:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3215090, 447618, 38407, '<td valign="top">I''m a little picky on her hair, but she''s a cutie. Can tell you used the paint brush on the background though.</td>', 'I''m a little picky on her hair, but she''s a cutie. Can tell you used the paint brush on the background though.', '2007-01-11 22:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3215091, 449044, 28359, '<td valign="top">Man, I really like this shot, but selective desat takes you out of the competition. 5</td>', 'Man, I really like this shot, but selective desat takes you out of the competition. 5', '2007-01-11 22:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3215094, 448728, 38407, '<td valign="top">so soft and innocent</td>', 'so soft and innocent', '2007-01-11 22:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
