(3215192, 450389, 19982, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting.  Lovely B&amp;W treatment.  Love the angled pose and the way the lines lead up to and frame her face.  Oh, and beautiful model too.<br/> <br/>Edit to add:  My pick for top 5.</td>', 'Very nice lighting.  Lovely B&W treatment.  Love the angled pose and the way the lines lead up to and frame her face.  Oh, and beautiful model too. Edit to add:  My pick for top 5.', '2007-01-11 23:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3215195, 448663, 19982, '<td valign="top">While not human, I''m giving this a high score for a portrait of a cat.  I believe the focus on the eyes is superb.  And the detail on the black cat is extremely well done.  With a bad exposure, it would be so easy to ruin this image .. too dark and you lose the detail on the cat, too bright and the rest of the image is blown.  Superbly exposed and processed!  And I like the crop / framing as well.<br/> <br/>Edit to add:  My pick for top 5.</td>', 'While not human, I''m giving this a high score for a portrait of a cat.  I believe the focus on the eyes is superb.  And the detail on the black cat is extremely well done.  With a bad exposure, it would be so easy to ruin this image .. too dark and you lose the detail on the cat, too bright and the rest of the image is blown.  Superbly exposed and processed!  And I like the crop / framing as well. Edit to add:  My pick for top 5.', '2007-01-11 23:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3215196, 447136, 19982, '<td valign="top">Love the crop!  The use of negative space and the ball help give a sense of "size" for the child.  Very playful pose and expression as well.  Love the lighting.  Well done!<br/> <br/>Edit to add:  My pick for top 5.</td>', 'Love the crop!  The use of negative space and the ball help give a sense of "size" for the child.  Very playful pose and expression as well.  Love the lighting.  Well done! Edit to add:  My pick for top 5.', '2007-01-11 23:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
