(3221167, 448480, 63588, '<td valign="top">Her head turned so far to her right bothers me - I want to look where she''s looking but then the sword draws my eye too. She appears to be smiling so it''s not as if she''s about to draw the sword to defend herself from whatever is coming from her right...</td>', 'Her head turned so far to her right bothers me - I want to look where she''s looking but then the sword draws my eye too. She appears to be smiling so it''s not as if she''s about to draw the sword to defend herself from whatever is coming from her right...', '2007-01-12 17:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3221173, 450467, 41746, '<td valign="top">I would like to see this portrait score high. The lighting is tad too hard but I like her expression, especially the hands. 8.</td>', 'I would like to see this portrait score high. The lighting is tad too hard but I like her expression, especially the hands. 8.', '2007-01-12 17:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3221175, 449295, 71969, '<td valign="top">not black and white portrait<br/>great photo otherwise - perhaps enter it in another challenge!</td>', 'not black and white portraitgreat photo otherwise - perhaps enter it in another challenge!', '2007-01-12 17:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3221182, 450819, 63588, '<td valign="top">nice composition but her nose seems a little soft.</td>', 'nice composition but her nose seems a little soft.', '2007-01-12 17:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3221194, 448693, 63588, '<td valign="top">Intense and nice dof. I find something distracting about the highlights - especially on his right cheek - it''s hard to see where the cloth and his cheek start and stop and that just feels weird.</td>', 'Intense and nice dof. I find something distracting about the highlights - especially on his right cheek - it''s hard to see where the cloth and his cheek start and stop and that just feels weird.', '2007-01-12 17:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
