(3221306, 450585, 33400, '<td valign="top">Focus is a little soft on your main subject here (the fiddler) and while I''m not a pro, this does not feel like a portrait to me.</td>', 'Focus is a little soft on your main subject here (the fiddler) and while I''m not a pro, this does not feel like a portrait to me.', '2007-01-12 17:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
