(3221358, 448162, 41746, '<td valign="top">Interesting and artful, intentional soft focus I assume and a look you don´t forget that easily. I like it. 9.</td>', 'Interesting and artful, intentional soft focus I assume and a look you don´t forget that easily. I like it. 9.', '2007-01-12 17:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
