(3223187, 450830, 43298, '<td valign="top">Very interesting, I like it but I daresay I might''ve liked it better without the whitish gradient I see.  But then again, now that i look at it again, it''s does work in a way. So anyways, either way, I think it''s cool :)</td>', 'Very interesting, I like it but I daresay I might''ve liked it better without the whitish gradient I see.  But then again, now that i look at it again, it''s does work in a way. So anyways, either way, I think it''s cool :)', '2007-01-12 22:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223193, 447446, 65319, '<td valign="top">Very emotive!  I love the lighting and the model''s expression.  10.</td>', 'Very emotive!  I love the lighting and the model''s expression.  10.', '2007-01-12 22:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
