(3223314, 448544, 44754, '<td valign="top">Sad Panda</td>', 'Sad Panda', '2007-01-12 23:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223319, 448162, 44754, '<td valign="top">Somebody give this kid a sandwich.</td>', 'Somebody give this kid a sandwich.', '2007-01-12 23:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223332, 450821, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites in the challenge.  I like how you captured that old school feeling - just a really classic look.  9</td>', 'This is one of my favorites in the challenge.  I like how you captured that old school feeling - just a really classic look.  9', '2007-01-12 23:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223340, 450295, 44754, '<td valign="top">Those highlights are intense. Think could have been better if toned down.</td>', 'Those highlights are intense. Think could have been better if toned down.', '2007-01-12 23:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223352, 447173, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like your interpretation of the challenge theme.  It is true that it did not really state that the photo HAD to be black and white.  However, I think it would have been neat to see it in black and white, to compensate for the loss of some detail on the right side of the face - maybe it would have created some mood lighting there. lol</td>', 'I like your interpretation of the challenge theme.  It is true that it did not really state that the photo HAD to be black and white.  However, I think it would have been neat to see it in black and white, to compensate for the loss of some detail on the right side of the face - maybe it would have created some mood lighting there. lol', '2007-01-12 23:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223355, 450224, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is cool.  Nice way to show more than a head shot.</td>', 'This is cool.  Nice way to show more than a head shot.', '2007-01-12 23:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223369, 449957, 67697, '<td valign="top">i like the happy candid look you caught - very natural.  good lighting on the face too.  Wish I had teeth that white lol</td>', 'i like the happy candid look you caught - very natural.  good lighting on the face too.  Wish I had teeth that white lol', '2007-01-12 23:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223373, 448358, 67697, '<td valign="top">what a sweet, innocent face.  the eyes really catch your attention.</td>', 'what a sweet, innocent face.  the eyes really catch your attention.', '2007-01-12 23:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223375, 448690, 67697, '<td valign="top">what a really cool idea.  One of my faves.  I think I will have to try this.  Too bad you lost some detail on the little one''s foot.</td>', 'what a really cool idea.  One of my faves.  I think I will have to try this.  Too bad you lost some detail on the little one''s foot.', '2007-01-12 23:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223384, 447464, 67697, '<td valign="top">this just cracked me up... may you be lucky to feel the pain of birth and delivery lol</td>', 'this just cracked me up... may you be lucky to feel the pain of birth and delivery lol', '2007-01-12 23:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223392, 450784, 67697, '<td valign="top">Aww sweet face!  Good detail.  I like the lighting.  There must be some technical composition answer for this - why did you leave the extra space to the right?</td>', 'Aww sweet face!  Good detail.  I like the lighting.  There must be some technical composition answer for this - why did you leave the extra space to the right?', '2007-01-12 23:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223393, 449098, 67697, '<td valign="top">I just love how the eyes pop out in this.  Beautiful!</td>', 'I just love how the eyes pop out in this.  Beautiful!', '2007-01-12 23:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223399, 450771, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like this - it looks like something you would see in a fashion magazine.  I like the border too.</td>', 'I like this - it looks like something you would see in a fashion magazine.  I like the border too.', '2007-01-12 23:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223400, 449548, 7810, '<td valign="top">Grit is good ... great shot hope this does well ... truly the best in challenge!</td>', 'Grit is good ... great shot hope this does well ... truly the best in challenge!', '2007-01-12 23:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223410, 449235, 67697, '<td valign="top">I''m sure people got on you about the color.  But I like the concept and I understand that you had to have the flowers pop out to really emphasize the vase.  I would like to have seen a little more crop off the top.</td>', 'I''m sure people got on you about the color.  But I like the concept and I understand that you had to have the flowers pop out to really emphasize the vase.  I would like to have seen a little more crop off the top.', '2007-01-12 23:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223422, 446993, 67697, '<td valign="top">Too bad you did not move the camera to get a different perspective.  The angled side of the grate is distracting and you lost details of the poor pups body on the right.  Sell the sad face!</td>', 'Too bad you did not move the camera to get a different perspective.  The angled side of the grate is distracting and you lost details of the poor pups body on the right.  Sell the sad face!', '2007-01-12 23:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223426, 448557, 67697, '<td valign="top">Love the changes in light on the face.</td>', 'Love the changes in light on the face.', '2007-01-12 23:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223429, 447469, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like the mood created by keeping the fence in.  Very serious look going on and the lighting reflects that well.</td>', 'I like the mood created by keeping the fence in.  Very serious look going on and the lighting reflects that well.', '2007-01-12 23:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223432, 449198, 67697, '<td valign="top">Is this a real one?  The lighting is awesome.</td>', 'Is this a real one?  The lighting is awesome.', '2007-01-12 23:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223446, 449295, 67697, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand how this got in here or if this is the one that was entered by mistake.  But I am giving some points cuz it looks cool.  Hopefully you have a description of what your title means.</td>', 'I don''t understand how this got in here or if this is the one that was entered by mistake.  But I am giving some points cuz it looks cool.  Hopefully you have a description of what your title means.', '2007-01-12 23:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223448, 450830, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love the whole mood with the curls and the faded areas.  Edit:  if you saw it, already I meant to write - 9</td>', 'I love the whole mood with the curls and the faded areas.  Edit:  if you saw it, already I meant to write - 9', '2007-01-12 23:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223460, 449554, 67697, '<td valign="top">You have a cute subject hidden in the shadows of the tree.  Plus I can see the photographer''s shadow.  Because you have too many things detracting from the subject, I gave you a 4.</td>', 'You have a cute subject hidden in the shadows of the tree.  Plus I can see the photographer''s shadow.  Because you have too many things detracting from the subject, I gave you a 4.', '2007-01-12 23:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223505, 447567, 67697, '<td valign="top">It''s obvious something has happened to his face and using this, you have come across creating a very artful (if that is a word lol) portrait.  It definitely shows a strong and defiant attitude.  It''s good - I hope he likes it.</td>', 'It''s obvious something has happened to his face and using this, you have come across creating a very artful (if that is a word lol) portrait.  It definitely shows a strong and defiant attitude.  It''s good - I hope he likes it.', '2007-01-12 23:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223526, 449988, 17203, '<td valign="top">I''m not loving the centered composition, but VERY nice expression, tones and focus.</td>', 'I''m not loving the centered composition, but VERY nice expression, tones and focus.', '2007-01-12 23:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223562, 448119, 17203, '<td valign="top">Hmm... looks like you had a great model to work with, but the photo comes up short IMO in a few areas. Most of the values are pure black or white, with relatively few midtones, so it creates a harsh appearance on a model with a soft expression. The centered composition seems static and doesn''t direct attention... most viewers will look at the face first and the follow the eyes immediately out of the photo. The graphics on the shirt don''t help either. Imagine the same shot with a different shirt, softer lighting (like a big window on an overcast day), and cropped with more room off to the left. THAT would be a good score. As-is, it''s about a 5 from me.</td>', 'Hmm... looks like you had a great model to work with, but the photo comes up short IMO in a few areas. Most of the values are pure black or white, with relatively few midtones, so it creates a harsh appearance on a model with a soft expression. The centered composition seems static and doesn''t direct attention... most viewers will look at the face first and the follow the eyes immediately out of the photo. The graphics on the shirt don''t help either. Imagine the same shot with a different shirt, softer lighting (like a big window on an overcast day), and cropped with more room off to the left. THAT would be a good score. As-is, it''s about a 5 from me.', '2007-01-13 00:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223575, 448125, 10768, '<td valign="top">This one amuses me.  I really like the expression.</td>', 'This one amuses me.  I really like the expression.', '2007-01-13 00:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223577, 447876, 50695, '<td valign="top">I want to see the shovel a little better.</td>', 'I want to see the shovel a little better.', '2007-01-13 00:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223579, 449084, 17203, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big fan of super-high constrast B&amp;W, but your model''s great expression bails you out here somewhat. With better lighting, this could be a formidable photo.</td>', 'I''m not a big fan of super-high constrast B&W, but your model''s great expression bails you out here somewhat. With better lighting, this could be a formidable photo.', '2007-01-13 00:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223595, 449692, 17203, '<td valign="top">Great capture, but the processing didn''t quite take advantage of its potential. It looks like you had the data available for sharp, contrasty eyes, but you''ve left them mostly gray and soft. If you have Photoshop available, try this again with the Luko sharpening technique (search the forums). Use Channel Mixer with mostly the green channel to convert to gray, and then dodge the eyes a little in Highlight mode. It should make a HUGE difference. ;-)</td>', 'Great capture, but the processing didn''t quite take advantage of its potential. It looks like you had the data available for sharp, contrasty eyes, but you''ve left them mostly gray and soft. If you have Photoshop available, try this again with the Luko sharpening technique (search the forums). Use Channel Mixer with mostly the green channel to convert to gray, and then dodge the eyes a little in Highlight mode. It should make a HUGE difference. ;-)', '2007-01-13 00:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223604, 448568, 50695, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the metaphor.</td>', 'I don''t get the metaphor.', '2007-01-13 00:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223608, 446793, 17203, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, but probably not the portrait the voters are expecting.</td>', 'Very pretty, but probably not the portrait the voters are expecting.', '2007-01-13 00:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223610, 450657, 10768, '<td valign="top">Technically, this photo is very well done.  I have gone back to this one many times because I like it, but there is something about it that detracts.  I think looking at it again, that the umbrella kind of steals the show.  Not to say your grandaughter isn''t beautiful (she is very much so)but the lace against the black draws my eyes away from her.  Maybe a portrait crop with one side of the umbrella cut off would have helped.  Hope you''re not offended, I was just offering my 2 cents.  I still think it''s a very fine portrait.</td>', 'Technically, this photo is very well done.  I have gone back to this one many times because I like it, but there is something about it that detracts.  I think looking at it again, that the umbrella kind of steals the show.  Not to say your grandaughter isn''t beautiful (she is very much so)but the lace against the black draws my eyes away from her.  Maybe a portrait crop with one side of the umbrella cut off would have helped.  Hope you''re not offended, I was just offering my 2 cents.  I still think it''s a very fine portrait.', '2007-01-13 00:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223617, 449813, 17203, '<td valign="top">I suspect that you''re probably not very happy with the score on this one, since most voters will be looking for a person in a portrait challenge. You CAN get away with a pet, but only with an exceptional expression and/or lighting. This, I''m afraid, has neither although the focus and composition are pretty good.</td>', 'I suspect that you''re probably not very happy with the score on this one, since most voters will be looking for a person in a portrait challenge. You CAN get away with a pet, but only with an exceptional expression and/or lighting. This, I''m afraid, has neither although the focus and composition are pretty good.', '2007-01-13 00:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223628, 449763, 17203, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and model, but full sun will kill you on B&amp;W. Try shooting under the shade of a tree or umbrella or wait for a cloudy day for much softer skin tones and controllable whites.</td>', 'Nice composition and model, but full sun will kill you on B&W. Try shooting under the shade of a tree or umbrella or wait for a cloudy day for much softer skin tones and controllable whites.', '2007-01-13 00:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223633, 449857, 17203, '<td valign="top">Great model, lighting, tones and composition. Excellent job! A more compelling expression would have earned you that last point. 9</td>', 'Great model, lighting, tones and composition. Excellent job! A more compelling expression would have earned you that last point. 9', '2007-01-13 00:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223663, 449965, 17203, '<td valign="top">Something strange about the processing on this one... the dog has some rich, dark tones in the face, while the light on your pretty model seems relatively flat and washed out. A different method of B&amp;W conversion (Channel Mixer, for example) or a little work with the burn tool would make a big difference here IMO. Also, watch out for distractions like that triangular shape in the background. Anything that doesn''t add to your shot, takes away from it.</td>', 'Something strange about the processing on this one... the dog has some rich, dark tones in the face, while the light on your pretty model seems relatively flat and washed out. A different method of B&W conversion (Channel Mixer, for example) or a little work with the burn tool would make a big difference here IMO. Also, watch out for distractions like that triangular shape in the background. Anything that doesn''t add to your shot, takes away from it.', '2007-01-13 00:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223677, 450867, 49305, '<td valign="top">not quite in focus.</td>', 'not quite in focus.', '2007-01-13 00:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223680, 449307, 17203, '<td valign="top">An interesting composition with good potential, but the B&amp;W conversion will kill your score on this one. The whole shot is fairly gray, with no richness to the shadows and a mottled texture overall. Sorry! :-(</td>', 'An interesting composition with good potential, but the B&W conversion will kill your score on this one. The whole shot is fairly gray, with no richness to the shadows and a mottled texture overall. Sorry! :-(', '2007-01-13 00:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
