(3224382, 448634, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: A creative idea for a portrait but the eyes look over processed.  This is easily fixable. 6</td>', 'Back to comment: A creative idea for a portrait but the eyes look over processed.  This is easily fixable. 6', '2007-01-13 06:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224389, 450212, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: Very nice work with the B&amp;W conversion.  I would have loved to have seen the catch light from the window a bit more off center in the eyes.  Bumping to a 7</td>', 'Back to comment: Very nice work with the B&W conversion.  I would have loved to have seen the catch light from the window a bit more off center in the eyes.  Bumping to a 7', '2007-01-13 06:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224393, 447234, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: Very nice work with the B&amp;W conversion.  The lighting is well done and the eyes are sharply focused.  The only things stopping me from rating this higher is that the facial expression.  The expression and especially the eyes have a forced look to them instead of looking relaxed.</td>', 'Back to comment: Very nice work with the B&W conversion.  The lighting is well done and the eyes are sharply focused.  The only things stopping me from rating this higher is that the facial expression.  The expression and especially the eyes have a forced look to them instead of looking relaxed.', '2007-01-13 06:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224401, 450623, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: You have done a nice job with the lighting, as it is very dramatic.  I also like your use of shallow depth of view.  However, the negative space on the right side of the image is a bit large and the black border looks really strange underneath a cropped facial feature.</td>', 'Back to comment: You have done a nice job with the lighting, as it is very dramatic.  I also like your use of shallow depth of view.  However, the negative space on the right side of the image is a bit large and the black border looks really strange underneath a cropped facial feature.', '2007-01-13 06:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224409, 447171, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: I''m betting this image is pretty close to what you were trying to achieve.  The black makeup around the eyes doesnt do much for me personally but since it is intentional, it didnt affect my score.  I do think the pupils look a bit over processed.  Very creative portrait and keep up the good work.</td>', 'Back to comment: I''m betting this image is pretty close to what you were trying to achieve.  The black makeup around the eyes doesnt do much for me personally but since it is intentional, it didnt affect my score.  I do think the pupils look a bit over processed.  Very creative portrait and keep up the good work.', '2007-01-13 06:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224415, 450695, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: I''m betting this image is pretty close to what you were trying to achieve.  However, the limited depth of view doesnt work very well with the head gear, what ever it is.  The lighting is pretty decent but the guys left eye looks too bright for the amount of light on that side of his face.  Im assuming you did a separate levels or curves layer for the eyes and processed them at the same time.</td>', 'Back to comment: I''m betting this image is pretty close to what you were trying to achieve.  However, the limited depth of view doesnt work very well with the head gear, what ever it is.  The lighting is pretty decent but the guys left eye looks too bright for the amount of light on that side of his face.  Im assuming you did a separate levels or curves layer for the eyes and processed them at the same time.', '2007-01-13 06:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224421, 450400, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: I like the composition and the lighting of this image but the B&amp;W conversion looks a bit off to me.  The mans skin almost looks like it might be green or some other odd color if I saw the color version.</td>', 'Back to comment: I like the composition and the lighting of this image but the B&W conversion looks a bit off to me.  The mans skin almost looks like it might be green or some other odd color if I saw the color version.', '2007-01-13 06:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224425, 450628, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: This image doesn''t really say portrait to me, as the man doesn''t come across as the main subject.  The direction he is facing leads my eyes back to the turntables and record covers.  You might consider clonging out the shelve brackets at the very top right side of the iamge also.</td>', 'Back to comment: This image doesn''t really say portrait to me, as the man doesn''t come across as the main subject.  The direction he is facing leads my eyes back to the turntables and record covers.  You might consider clonging out the shelve brackets at the very top right side of the iamge also.', '2007-01-13 06:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224429, 450026, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: Very nice work with the B&amp;W conversion.  The lighting is well done and the eyes are sharply focused.  The only things stopping me from rating this higher is that the background has a few distractions in it.  You might also want to clone out some of the catch lights in the eyes so there is only one in each pupil.</td>', 'Back to comment: Very nice work with the B&W conversion.  The lighting is well done and the eyes are sharply focused.  The only things stopping me from rating this higher is that the background has a few distractions in it.  You might also want to clone out some of the catch lights in the eyes so there is only one in each pupil.', '2007-01-13 06:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224430, 449526, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: Very nice work with the B&amp;W conversion.  The lighting is well done and the eyes are sharply focused.  Giving you a bump, as I under-rated it the first time I looked at it.</td>', 'Back to comment: Very nice work with the B&W conversion.  The lighting is well done and the eyes are sharply focused.  Giving you a bump, as I under-rated it the first time I looked at it.', '2007-01-13 06:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224443, 447026, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: A creative idea for a portrait but the eye could have been a little sharper.  The interesting thing about your composition is that with the eye looking up, the image conveys the why do I have to pose attitude.  If the eye would have been straight forward, it would have conveyed anger or stubbornness.  This is really effective compositionally and Im going to give you a bump.</td>', 'Back to comment: A creative idea for a portrait but the eye could have been a little sharper.  The interesting thing about your composition is that with the eye looking up, the image conveys the why do I have to pose attitude.  If the eye would have been straight forward, it would have conveyed anger or stubbornness.  This is really effective compositionally and Im going to give you a bump.', '2007-01-13 07:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224466, 448586, 66201, '<td valign="top">Lovely soft light with a very expressive face. Lovely pet portrait.7</td>', 'Lovely soft light with a very expressive face. Lovely pet portrait.7', '2007-01-13 07:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224467, 448557, 66201, '<td valign="top">7</td>', '7', '2007-01-13 07:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224469, 450295, 66201, '<td valign="top">This is lovely, but I generally don''t like high key shots.This is just a preference thing though. Good composition, lovely subject, gorgeous title, and a real sense of life and movement.</td>', 'This is lovely, but I generally don''t like high key shots.This is just a preference thing though. Good composition, lovely subject, gorgeous title, and a real sense of life and movement.', '2007-01-13 07:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224473, 448438, 66201, '<td valign="top">I like the grain in this...gives a classic ''70''s look to the composition. Nice breathing space around the character too. 7</td>', 'I like the grain in this...gives a classic ''70''s look to the composition. Nice breathing space around the character too. 7', '2007-01-13 07:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224474, 448693, 66201, '<td valign="top">Something''s happening to the skin around the eyes and nose...looks glassy? The smoke is distracting only to the point that I had to look for a moment or two to decided what was happening to the cheek, but now that I''ve "got it" it''s okay.</td>', 'Something''s happening to the skin around the eyes and nose...looks glassy? The smoke is distracting only to the point that I had to look for a moment or two to decided what was happening to the cheek, but now that I''ve "got it" it''s okay.', '2007-01-13 07:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224485, 448140, 66201, '<td valign="top">Unusual and dramatic...I''m sure you''ll get hammered for it not being a "real" portrait...but I think it''s captivating. I also happen to like the grain in it..something about black and white and grain...a kind of marriage made in the 70''s.</td>', 'Unusual and dramatic...I''m sure you''ll get hammered for it not being a "real" portrait...but I think it''s captivating. I also happen to like the grain in it..something about black and white and grain...a kind of marriage made in the 70''s.', '2007-01-13 07:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224486, 450822, 66201, '<td valign="top">Sorry, don''t speak French and with nearly 500 pictures to comment on, I don''t have time to look up the meaning... but I''m commenting on the image anyway. Well composed, good lighting and nice clarity.</td>', 'Sorry, don''t speak French and with nearly 500 pictures to comment on, I don''t have time to look up the meaning... but I''m commenting on the image anyway. Well composed, good lighting and nice clarity.', '2007-01-13 07:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224487, 450616, 66201, '<td valign="top">Hey...hope you do well with this. I used the same poem for my "Reflections" challenge and it did very badly. I put 3 days of shooting into it and came away with an "early newbie" picture. Very difficult to line up that reflection I know!!! The darkness of this is very Sylvia though.</td>', 'Hey...hope you do well with this. I used the same poem for my "Reflections" challenge and it did very badly. I put 3 days of shooting into it and came away with an "early newbie" picture. Very difficult to line up that reflection I know!!! The darkness of this is very Sylvia though.', '2007-01-13 07:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224535, 450499, 46463, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit blurred</td>', 'Seems a bit blurred', '2007-01-13 07:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224541, 449631, 47852, '<td valign="top">It feels like you''re missing the full range of tones with this one.  A slight adjustment of levels would be helpful.  A nice moment captured though.</td>', 'It feels like you''re missing the full range of tones with this one.  A slight adjustment of levels would be helpful.  A nice moment captured though.', '2007-01-13 07:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224550, 448879, 47852, '<td valign="top">Fun shot... really shows off the personality of this person.  The focus seems a little soft though, especially on the eyes.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Fun shot... really shows off the personality of this person.  The focus seems a little soft though, especially on the eyes.  Nicely done!', '2007-01-13 07:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224554, 448344, 47852, '<td valign="top">Love the high key treatment to this shot.  It feels just a little too blown out across the cheeks since it goes almost the whole way across the face... almost splits it into two.  Adorable shot though!  Well done!</td>', 'Love the high key treatment to this shot.  It feels just a little too blown out across the cheeks since it goes almost the whole way across the face... almost splits it into two.  Adorable shot though!  Well done!', '2007-01-13 07:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224555, 450232, 47852, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.. would like to see you take full advantage of the size restrictions though with this one.</td>', 'Nicely done.. would like to see you take full advantage of the size restrictions though with this one.', '2007-01-13 07:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224578, 450156, 47852, '<td valign="top">She seems so detatched from the baby when she''s looking away.  I would have rather seen her engaging with the child.  Nice range of tones though in this shot.</td>', 'She seems so detatched from the baby when she''s looking away.  I would have rather seen her engaging with the child.  Nice range of tones though in this shot.', '2007-01-13 08:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
