(3224712, 449780, 2490, '<td valign="top">Great bg lighting, but the face doesn''t seem sharp.  Great exposure, and maybe you wanted a soft look.  Don''t mind soft, but it looks accidental.</td>', 'Great bg lighting, but the face doesn''t seem sharp.  Great exposure, and maybe you wanted a soft look.  Don''t mind soft, but it looks accidental.', '2007-01-13 08:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
