(3224716, 448152, 2490, '<td valign="top">He looks too surprised, in a way.  Nice bokeh.</td>', 'He looks too surprised, in a way.  Nice bokeh.', '2007-01-13 08:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224719, 448588, 2490, '<td valign="top">Wow. Lotsa blur. Cute kids, though.</td>', 'Wow. Lotsa blur. Cute kids, though.', '2007-01-13 08:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224721, 449957, 70828, '<td valign="top">A little too sepia for my taste.</td>', 'A little too sepia for my taste.', '2007-01-13 08:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224726, 448115, 2490, '<td valign="top">If this was an intentional setup rather than just an opportunity, I commend you.  Good choice of setting.  I would have tried to use some fill flash and thus kept a little more detail in the sky.  Prolly would have cloned out the white parking line, too.  Nice :)</td>', 'If this was an intentional setup rather than just an opportunity, I commend you.  Good choice of setting.  I would have tried to use some fill flash and thus kept a little more detail in the sky.  Prolly would have cloned out the white parking line, too.  Nice :)', '2007-01-13 08:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224727, 449603, 2490, '<td valign="top">Too dark, even if intentional.</td>', 'Too dark, even if intentional.', '2007-01-13 08:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224729, 447809, 2490, '<td valign="top">Good directional lighting.  Catch lights wound up at a little bit of a weird spot in the eyes, though.</td>', 'Good directional lighting.  Catch lights wound up at a little bit of a weird spot in the eyes, though.', '2007-01-13 08:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224730, 450862, 2490, '<td valign="top">As a "portrait", I think it needs more light on the face instead of the hand.  Great idea.</td>', 'As a "portrait", I think it needs more light on the face instead of the hand.  Great idea.', '2007-01-13 08:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224731, 450540, 2490, '<td valign="top">Doggone shadow.</td>', 'Doggone shadow.', '2007-01-13 08:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224732, 447974, 70828, '<td valign="top">A tad too sepia for my taste.</td>', 'A tad too sepia for my taste.', '2007-01-13 08:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224735, 450715, 2490, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s almost a true monochrome.  Too blue for me.</td>', 'Wow, that''s almost a true monochrome.  Too blue for me.', '2007-01-13 08:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224739, 450742, 2490, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.  Looks like USM put in some hard details, and that makes the face a little more harsh than a "portrait" typically needs.  Good shot.</td>', 'Nice lighting.  Looks like USM put in some hard details, and that makes the face a little more harsh than a "portrait" typically needs.  Good shot.', '2007-01-13 08:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224741, 447684, 2490, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  A gnat''s hair more depth of field to bring his right eye into focus would have made this ROCK.</td>', 'Excellent.  A gnat''s hair more depth of field to bring his right eye into focus would have made this ROCK.', '2007-01-13 08:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224745, 450333, 2490, '<td valign="top">I don''t like "portraits" with dark faces, but this has a lot of potential.</td>', 'I don''t like "portraits" with dark faces, but this has a lot of potential.', '2007-01-13 08:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224746, 448787, 2490, '<td valign="top">Makes me wanna turn my head because I can''t figure out what she really looks like at this angle :)</td>', 'Makes me wanna turn my head because I can''t figure out what she really looks like at this angle :)', '2007-01-13 08:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224748, 448744, 2490, '<td valign="top">Wide angle brings out the nose a little; while that''s not a "sin", it seems to detract from this shot for me.  Nice light!</td>', 'Wide angle brings out the nose a little; while that''s not a "sin", it seems to detract from this shot for me.  Nice light!', '2007-01-13 08:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224754, 449744, 2490, '<td valign="top">Classic focal length for no distortion, good lighting with only slight shadow (appears to be single light source?) but it really feels flat.  Need some front to back depth somehow.  Maybe too close to the background.</td>', 'Classic focal length for no distortion, good lighting with only slight shadow (appears to be single light source?) but it really feels flat.  Need some front to back depth somehow.  Maybe too close to the background.', '2007-01-13 08:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224755, 447488, 2490, '<td valign="top">Sinister lighting.  If intentional, well done.  I would like to see more "head outline", maybe a touch of backlighting so I can see the head shape rather than losing him in the background.</td>', 'Sinister lighting.  If intentional, well done.  I would like to see more "head outline", maybe a touch of backlighting so I can see the head shape rather than losing him in the background.', '2007-01-13 08:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224757, 450870, 2490, '<td valign="top">A bit soft.  Doesn''t appear to really be a portrait, just a shot to enter.  No insult intended, that''s just how it comes across.</td>', 'A bit soft.  Doesn''t appear to really be a portrait, just a shot to enter.  No insult intended, that''s just how it comes across.', '2007-01-13 08:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224763, 450224, 2490, '<td valign="top">Clever, good lighting, good focus.  Probably top 10.  Doesn''t feel like a "portrait" to me, though.  :)</td>', 'Clever, good lighting, good focus.  Probably top 10.  Doesn''t feel like a "portrait" to me, though.  :)', '2007-01-13 08:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224765, 449235, 2490, '<td valign="top">Good shot, I just have trouble with this definition of a "portrait".  Might win an OOBIE, don''t know.</td>', 'Good shot, I just have trouble with this definition of a "portrait".  Might win an OOBIE, don''t know.', '2007-01-13 08:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224768, 448194, 2490, '<td valign="top">Need a touch more contrast, but excellent shot.</td>', 'Need a touch more contrast, but excellent shot.', '2007-01-13 08:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3224769, 447221, 2490, '<td valign="top">Hand position looks too accidental.</td>', 'Hand position looks too accidental.', '2007-01-13 08:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
