(3226402, 448411, 62626, '<td valign="top">nice photo! I love how the highlights are blown on the one cheeck, but the lashes really stand out.</td>', 'nice photo! I love how the highlights are blown on the one cheeck, but the lashes really stand out.', '2007-01-13 15:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226407, 447875, 71239, '<td valign="top">Great character - you''ve just cropped the top of the hair and I would have preferred to see it all if possible, but still a great shot.</td>', 'Great character - you''ve just cropped the top of the hair and I would have preferred to see it all if possible, but still a great shot.', '2007-01-13 15:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226415, 447817, 71239, '<td valign="top">The highlights are just a little blown for me, but a fantastic character shot!</td>', 'The highlights are just a little blown for me, but a fantastic character shot!', '2007-01-13 15:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226440, 449469, 71239, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tone to this shot, great crop selection.  Is the focus point just a fraction off (on the eye ridges &amp; nose - instead of on the eyes)?</td>', 'Beautiful tone to this shot, great crop selection.  Is the focus point just a fraction off (on the eye ridges & nose - instead of on the eyes)?', '2007-01-13 16:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226450, 450870, 71239, '<td valign="top">Unconventional to crop across the tops of the eyes, but it works for me - nice and staring.</td>', 'Unconventional to crop across the tops of the eyes, but it works for me - nice and staring.', '2007-01-13 16:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226461, 447897, 71239, '<td valign="top">Imaginative angle!</td>', 'Imaginative angle!', '2007-01-13 16:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226476, 450659, 71239, '<td valign="top">White objects on dark backgrounds are always difficult - and here the whites are correctly exposed but the detail''s been lost in the dark tones, and because of the way the light''s falling on the head, it makes it hard to see the swan''s eye - which is the most important part of the shot.</td>', 'White objects on dark backgrounds are always difficult - and here the whites are correctly exposed but the detail''s been lost in the dark tones, and because of the way the light''s falling on the head, it makes it hard to see the swan''s eye - which is the most important part of the shot.', '2007-01-13 16:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226507, 450754, 71239, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel I can score this highly because it looks like a straight shot of someone else''s artwork. Sorry :-(</td>', 'I don''t feel I can score this highly because it looks like a straight shot of someone else''s artwork. Sorry :-(', '2007-01-13 16:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226515, 450617, 71239, '<td valign="top">I can see this as a landscape shot, but not so much as a portrait?</td>', 'I can see this as a landscape shot, but not so much as a portrait?', '2007-01-13 16:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226517, 449123, 71239, '<td valign="top">I think the cross-hatching filter/texture is fighting with the fur rather than enhancing the shot.  The hair has a very defined directional texture and maybe a crosshatch would work better on a less detailed subject like smooth skin?</td>', 'I think the cross-hatching filter/texture is fighting with the fur rather than enhancing the shot.  The hair has a very defined directional texture and maybe a crosshatch would work better on a less detailed subject like smooth skin?', '2007-01-13 16:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226537, 447435, 71239, '<td valign="top">A touching theme, perhaps the lighting is a bit too uniform and the shot needs a little more contrast?</td>', 'A touching theme, perhaps the lighting is a bit too uniform and the shot needs a little more contrast?', '2007-01-13 16:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226557, 450123, 7810, '<td valign="top">I like this shot ... nice contrast ... cute model.<br/>Try this... Crop tight on left to leave it less centered and tighter on the face maybe around the scarf height. More detail is better :)  Good luck</td>', 'I like this shot ... nice contrast ... cute model.Try this... Crop tight on left to leave it less centered and tighter on the face maybe around the scarf height. More detail is better :)  Good luck', '2007-01-13 16:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226560, 448755, 71239, '<td valign="top">I think if the child''s face was turned towards the camera a bit then the light would have produced catchlights in the eyes and improved the shot.</td>', 'I think if the child''s face was turned towards the camera a bit then the light would have produced catchlights in the eyes and improved the shot.', '2007-01-13 16:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226573, 448787, 554, '<td valign="top">uncomfortable to look at</td>', 'uncomfortable to look at', '2007-01-13 16:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226580, 448013, 71239, '<td valign="top">I find the light bar (fence top?) running behind the shoulders is a bit distracting.  Hard to get rid of I know, but with the face in shadow that sort of highlight draws my eye away fromt the face.</td>', 'I find the light bar (fence top?) running behind the shoulders is a bit distracting.  Hard to get rid of I know, but with the face in shadow that sort of highlight draws my eye away fromt the face.', '2007-01-13 16:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226599, 449095, 71239, '<td valign="top">I find the flash a little too harsh on this shot - it''s a shiny subject which means the reflection off the leg, stomach and post burns out.  might have been unavoidable if you only had a fixed on-camera flash available though.</td>', 'I find the flash a little too harsh on this shot - it''s a shiny subject which means the reflection off the leg, stomach and post burns out.  might have been unavoidable if you only had a fixed on-camera flash available though.', '2007-01-13 16:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226621, 450585, 71239, '<td valign="top">I feel the fiddler is a little lost with so many other people and the busy background - if he had been looking towards the camera it might have helped.  Perhaps the shot here is from knee level where the group of people are on the left - looking up at the fiddler to catch his face with the case and money in the foreground?</td>', 'I feel the fiddler is a little lost with so many other people and the busy background - if he had been looking towards the camera it might have helped.  Perhaps the shot here is from knee level where the group of people are on the left - looking up at the fiddler to catch his face with the case and money in the foreground?', '2007-01-13 16:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226629, 449223, 71239, '<td valign="top">More contrast would add a bit of punch to the shot?  The blacks are very light as it is.</td>', 'More contrast would add a bit of punch to the shot?  The blacks are very light as it is.', '2007-01-13 16:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226700, 450804, 29591, '<td valign="top">Cool portrait, I like the shadows.</td>', 'Cool portrait, I like the shadows.', '2007-01-13 16:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226744, 450295, 71239, '<td valign="top">For me there is a loss of detail around the bridge of the nose and on the forehead where the highlights have just washed out - a pity because the lower part of the face has nice high-key detail in the skin.</td>', 'For me there is a loss of detail around the bridge of the nose and on the forehead where the highlights have just washed out - a pity because the lower part of the face has nice high-key detail in the skin.', '2007-01-13 16:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226902, 450636, 29591, '<td valign="top">I love her smile, nice tones and sharpness. Good work keeping the hat from getting lost in the bckgrnd.</td>', 'I love her smile, nice tones and sharpness. Good work keeping the hat from getting lost in the bckgrnd.', '2007-01-13 17:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3226910, 447430, 62187, '<td valign="top">I''ll tell you what - if I get a ribbon I''ll give it to you. Oh wait, I didn''t enter this challenge. So, you''ll just have to settle for a 9 to help you along the way. I''m sorry, I can''t think of anything to help or that hurts your photo, it''s just a bizarre looking photo. Good luck to ya!</td>', 'I''ll tell you what - if I get a ribbon I''ll give it to you. Oh wait, I didn''t enter this challenge. So, you''ll just have to settle for a 9 to help you along the way. I''m sorry, I can''t think of anything to help or that hurts your photo, it''s just a bizarre looking photo. Good luck to ya!', '2007-01-13 17:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
