(3227961, 450634, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the way her hair and the hat isolate her face in black.  The tonal range I think is just a tad short on the high end (missing a true white).  Hmmm.  I just noticed the threads in the hat.  Those are white.  Perhaps the B/W points are correct, but her eyes and teeth seem like they could be a little brighter.  Just a thought.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the way her hair and the hat isolate her face in black.  The tonal range I think is just a tad short on the high end (missing a true white).  Hmmm.  I just noticed the threads in the hat.  Those are white.  Perhaps the B/W points are correct, but her eyes and teeth seem like they could be a little brighter.  Just a thought.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2007-01-13 22:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3227969, 448098, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful character in this portrait.  The painting helps I''m sure, but her eyes seem so serious, perhaps contemplative...beyond her years.  Hard to explain I guess.  Certainly an engaging photo.  Nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful character in this portrait.  The painting helps I''m sure, but her eyes seem so serious, perhaps contemplative...beyond her years.  Hard to explain I guess.  Certainly an engaging photo.  Nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-13 22:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3227983, 447016, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a tough one.  I like what you were approaching here with the framing of the subject, but it feels awkward.  Like I''d rather see more of his other eye, or not even a hint.  I''d imagine you struggled with this because to frame it tighter would then come into his nose and mouth more.  Hmmm.  Glad it was you that had to decide!  :D  Other than that it''s technically well done overall - maybe a touch warm on the cheek exposure wise.  Good detail and clarity.  Overall, well done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a tough one.  I like what you were approaching here with the framing of the subject, but it feels awkward.  Like I''d rather see more of his other eye, or not even a hint.  I''d imagine you struggled with this because to frame it tighter would then come into his nose and mouth more.  Hmmm.  Glad it was you that had to decide!  :D  Other than that it''s technically well done overall - maybe a touch warm on the cheek exposure wise.  Good detail and clarity.  Overall, well done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-13 22:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3227989, 450684, 30049, '<td valign="top">He has such a serious expression and I imagine those eyes are quite intense.  If only we could see them better.  :D  Focus is sharp around the nose but falls off fast and the eyes are way too soft IMO.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'He has such a serious expression and I imagine those eyes are quite intense.  If only we could see them better.  :D  Focus is sharp around the nose but falls off fast and the eyes are way too soft IMO.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-13 22:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
