(3228323, 450835, 70828, '<td valign="top">MAMA MIA! Very VERY nice! - 9 <br/> <br/>On second look ... I have to give this a 10!. It is a truly beautiful collaboration between model and photographer IMO ... and WHAT a model! Congrats.</td>', 'MAMA MIA! Very VERY nice! - 9  On second look ... I have to give this a 10!. It is a truly beautiful collaboration between model and photographer IMO ... and WHAT a model! Congrats.', '2007-01-13 23:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
