(3228366, 450297, 29513, '<td valign="top">I like the play of light and shadow but I would like to see some fill light on the right.  Nice expression.</td>', 'I like the play of light and shadow but I would like to see some fill light on the right.  Nice expression.', '2007-01-13 23:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
