(3228373, 450046, 44754, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen a few photo''s with added noise, but I don''t really like it. Sorry. Plus I think if it were cropped a little tighter it might be better. The roundish shape above left is a little distracting.</td>', 'I''ve seen a few photo''s with added noise, but I don''t really like it. Sorry. Plus I think if it were cropped a little tighter it might be better. The roundish shape above left is a little distracting.', '2007-01-13 23:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
