(3231796, 448568, 66310, '<td valign="top">wow! a real looker of a shot! I not only like the way you make the eyes stand out, but an interesting concept in adding the hose. Maybe I will try something like that. Very inspirational!</td>', 'wow! a real looker of a shot! I not only like the way you make the eyes stand out, but an interesting concept in adding the hose. Maybe I will try something like that. Very inspirational!', '2007-01-14 20:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3231802, 447360, 66310, '<td valign="top">I like the concept...but the lighting is a bit off</td>', 'I like the concept...but the lighting is a bit off', '2007-01-14 20:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3231809, 450564, 66310, '<td valign="top">very nice lighting!</td>', 'very nice lighting!', '2007-01-14 21:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3231897, 449037, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and detail.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice lighting and detail.  Well done.', '2007-01-14 21:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3231911, 450575, 30049, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but doesn''t seem much like a portrait photo to me.  No face, distant subject...  Little on the blurry side also.  JMO of course.  Good luck.</td>', 'Sorry, but doesn''t seem much like a portrait photo to me.  No face, distant subject...  Little on the blurry side also.  JMO of course.  Good luck.', '2007-01-14 21:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3231919, 447904, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice detail.  She seems so solemn and no gleam in her eye.  :(  Seems like this shot could use a slight boost in contrast.  JMO.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice detail.  She seems so solemn and no gleam in her eye.  :(  Seems like this shot could use a slight boost in contrast.  JMO.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-14 21:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232043, 448557, 25952, '<td valign="top">really nice composition and light.</td>', 'really nice composition and light.', '2007-01-14 22:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232099, 450842, 61379, '<td valign="top">Perfect 10!</td>', 'Perfect 10!', '2007-01-14 22:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232171, 449662, 46993, '<td valign="top">Great range- it''s tough to not blow out those white values.  Very good composition too.  The eyes are superior.  I''m bumping this one up after my last sweep through- 10.</td>', 'Great range- it''s tough to not blow out those white values.  Very good composition too.  The eyes are superior.  I''m bumping this one up after my last sweep through- 10.', '2007-01-14 22:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232178, 447041, 46993, '<td valign="top">I know somebody is going to hit you for blowing out those whites but I still really, really like this.  Good framing.  I don''t know if the writing on the shirt is a distraction but I''m giving this a 9.  Good job!</td>', 'I know somebody is going to hit you for blowing out those whites but I still really, really like this.  Good framing.  I don''t know if the writing on the shirt is a distraction but I''m giving this a 9.  Good job!', '2007-01-14 22:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232188, 450727, 46993, '<td valign="top">I really like this one.  To me, it''s different.  The lighting definately adds to the composition.  Lit differently I don''t think it would be nearly as interesting.  Thanks for taking a chance and for this entry.  Great job.</td>', 'I really like this one.  To me, it''s different.  The lighting definately adds to the composition.  Lit differently I don''t think it would be nearly as interesting.  Thanks for taking a chance and for this entry.  Great job.', '2007-01-14 22:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232218, 447684, 46993, '<td valign="top">I liked all the ''character studies'' including this one.  Great DOF.  Very sharp.  Nice tones.  This is one of my favorites.</td>', 'I liked all the ''character studies'' including this one.  Great DOF.  Very sharp.  Nice tones.  This is one of my favorites.', '2007-01-14 22:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232232, 449978, 46993, '<td valign="top">I like what I like and I like this one.  I can''t break it down beyond the fact that it has a certain ''editorial'' quality to it.  And I just really like it.  I ranked this way up.  Good luck.  Great photo.</td>', 'I like what I like and I like this one.  I can''t break it down beyond the fact that it has a certain ''editorial'' quality to it.  And I just really like it.  I ranked this way up.  Good luck.  Great photo.', '2007-01-14 22:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232240, 447016, 46993, '<td valign="top">Great framing.  The first thing I always focus in on is the eyes.  This shot has great eyes.  Good range, good use of negative space.  Nice, very nice photo.  Good luck.</td>', 'Great framing.  The first thing I always focus in on is the eyes.  This shot has great eyes.  Good range, good use of negative space.  Nice, very nice photo.  Good luck.', '2007-01-14 22:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232252, 447872, 46993, '<td valign="top">I ranked this VERY high but I think you might take a hit because of the dead center framing, I like it.  Good range of tones, tack sharp, great lighting.  Great photo.</td>', 'I ranked this VERY high but I think you might take a hit because of the dead center framing, I like it.  Good range of tones, tack sharp, great lighting.  Great photo.', '2007-01-14 22:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232261, 447460, 46993, '<td valign="top">Great photo, creamy dreamlike quality- choice of subject and lighting work well together.  Great range of tones.  Great photo.</td>', 'Great photo, creamy dreamlike quality- choice of subject and lighting work well together.  Great range of tones.  Great photo.', '2007-01-14 22:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232270, 450523, 46993, '<td valign="top">I think you took a chance and it paid off.  Look at the eye.  Superior.  Great tone/lighting with that high upper right, bright white to the opposite corner almost black.  All done, I''m sure by design.  This will end up finishing very high.  Great job.  Thanks for this one.</td>', 'I think you took a chance and it paid off.  Look at the eye.  Superior.  Great tone/lighting with that high upper right, bright white to the opposite corner almost black.  All done, I''m sure by design.  This will end up finishing very high.  Great job.  Thanks for this one.', '2007-01-14 22:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232285, 448568, 46993, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked at this a bunch of times.  I''m not that bright, I can''t get the significance of the hose.  When it''s all over this is one I''m coming back to read more about.  I really like it and ranked it high but wanted to come back and let you know before the contest was over- great job!</td>', 'I''ve looked at this a bunch of times.  I''m not that bright, I can''t get the significance of the hose.  When it''s all over this is one I''m coming back to read more about.  I really like it and ranked it high but wanted to come back and let you know before the contest was over- great job!', '2007-01-14 22:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232297, 450450, 46993, '<td valign="top">You''ll probably get hammered for the high key lighting but I think it works.  Makes for an interesting study in contrast and composition.  I ranked this high and just wanted to let you know so before the contest ends.  Thanks for entering this.</td>', 'You''ll probably get hammered for the high key lighting but I think it works.  Makes for an interesting study in contrast and composition.  I ranked this high and just wanted to let you know so before the contest ends.  Thanks for entering this.', '2007-01-14 22:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232316, 450821, 46993, '<td valign="top">I don''t care what others might say, I REALLY like this and wanted to let you know so before the contest ends.  It''s the anti-portrait, portrait and for me it works well.  I''ll be interested to see how others viewed this.  I don''t care... I like it.  Good job.</td>', 'I don''t care what others might say, I REALLY like this and wanted to let you know so before the contest ends.  It''s the anti-portrait, portrait and for me it works well.  I''ll be interested to see how others viewed this.  I don''t care... I like it.  Good job.', '2007-01-14 22:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232327, 449526, 36403, '<td valign="top">Great lighting &amp; beautiful eyes.  I would tap in to the "vulnerable" feel by raising the camera and having her look up at you - but this is a gorgeous portrait in &amp; of itself.  8</td>', 'Great lighting & beautiful eyes.  I would tap in to the "vulnerable" feel by raising the camera and having her look up at you - but this is a gorgeous portrait in & of itself.  8', '2007-01-14 22:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232333, 448933, 47852, '<td valign="top">I love when a portrait tells a story about the person... this is wonderful!  DOF is just right... enough to focus on the face, and show the photos, but also enough to separate them.</td>', 'I love when a portrait tells a story about the person... this is wonderful!  DOF is just right... enough to focus on the face, and show the photos, but also enough to separate them.', '2007-01-14 22:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232339, 447817, 46993, '<td valign="top">I really like this one.  Some of it has gotten blown out but I think the range of tones is very good.  I didn''t want this to end without letting you know that I thought it was a very, very good image.  Good job.</td>', 'I really like this one.  Some of it has gotten blown out but I think the range of tones is very good.  I didn''t want this to end without letting you know that I thought it was a very, very good image.  Good job.', '2007-01-14 22:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232342, 449753, 36403, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait.  Great DOF.  A couple of things I think would improve this would be a tighter crop, and maybe a fill flash to bring out a little pop in the eyes.  6</td>', 'Nice portrait.  Great DOF.  A couple of things I think would improve this would be a tighter crop, and maybe a fill flash to bring out a little pop in the eyes.  6', '2007-01-14 23:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232361, 447239, 46993, '<td valign="top">I ranked this very, very high.  Selfishly, I would like to see more of the detail.  Great model.  I wish you didn''t have to reduce the image quality to get it to fit in the challenge guidelines.  The angles work well, classic.  Didn''t want this to end without letting you know how good I thought this ended up being. Great photo.</td>', 'I ranked this very, very high.  Selfishly, I would like to see more of the detail.  Great model.  I wish you didn''t have to reduce the image quality to get it to fit in the challenge guidelines.  The angles work well, classic.  Didn''t want this to end without letting you know how good I thought this ended up being. Great photo.', '2007-01-14 23:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
