(3232374, 450489, 46993, '<td valign="top">Another great, anti-portrait, candid portrait.  I like the noise, I think it works well. You got a little blow out but it gives you the bright whites you needed.  I ranked this very high and although cleavage usually helps scores I think it''s a ''wash'' in this shot.  Great entry!</td>', 'Another great, anti-portrait, candid portrait.  I like the noise, I think it works well. You got a little blow out but it gives you the bright whites you needed.  I ranked this very high and although cleavage usually helps scores I think it''s a ''wash'' in this shot.  Great entry!', '2007-01-14 23:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232376, 447904, 36403, '<td valign="top">This is nice, but the hair in her face is distracting.  I would also add some fill flash or a reflector to bring out catchlights in her eyes, and up your contrast a little.  5</td>', 'This is nice, but the hair in her face is distracting.  I would also add some fill flash or a reflector to bring out catchlights in her eyes, and up your contrast a little.  5', '2007-01-14 23:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
