(3232493, 450515, 30049, '<td valign="top">Those are some glasses!  :D  It''s kind of cool in a way because with the eyes basically hidden the other facial features then become prominent.  For instance, the details of her mouth really stand out.  Well put together.  Will be interesting to see how this does when all is said and done for the challenge.  Good luck.</td>', 'Those are some glasses!  :D  It''s kind of cool in a way because with the eyes basically hidden the other facial features then become prominent.  For instance, the details of her mouth really stand out.  Well put together.  Will be interesting to see how this does when all is said and done for the challenge.  Good luck.', '2007-01-14 23:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232498, 449554, 36403, '<td valign="top">What an adorable little model you have!  To me, a portrait is all about the eyes... you want them to be in as sharp a focus as possible &amp; the face is a little soft here.  The tree provides a great setting, but the doppled shadows are distracting.  It would look better if you could use a diffuser (a white sheet, perhaps) to block the sun and cause less shadowing.  Also, you want to look for things like your shadow in the bottom right corner - next time, if you see your shadow, move your body or change your perspective until your shadow is no longer there.  Hope these help a little!</td>', 'What an adorable little model you have!  To me, a portrait is all about the eyes... you want them to be in as sharp a focus as possible & the face is a little soft here.  The tree provides a great setting, but the doppled shadows are distracting.  It would look better if you could use a diffuser (a white sheet, perhaps) to block the sun and cause less shadowing.  Also, you want to look for things like your shadow in the bottom right corner - next time, if you see your shadow, move your body or change your perspective until your shadow is no longer there.  Hope these help a little!', '2007-01-14 23:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232499, 449037, 36403, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  10</td>', 'Very nice.  10', '2007-01-14 23:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232501, 450585, 71392, '<td valign="top">Not a portrait (or subject too far) = 1</td>', 'Not a portrait (or subject too far) = 1', '2007-01-14 23:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232503, 447001, 46993, '<td valign="top">The eyes are great.  They really add to the image.  The composition add to the shot.  You have a couple of stray hairs but it doesn''t detract from the image.  This is one of my favorites and I wanted to let you know how good I thought it was before the challenge ended.  Great photo.</td>', 'The eyes are great.  They really add to the image.  The composition add to the shot.  You have a couple of stray hairs but it doesn''t detract from the image.  This is one of my favorites and I wanted to let you know how good I thought it was before the challenge ended.  Great photo.', '2007-01-14 23:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3232510, 449963, 46993, '<td valign="top">This is a great image.  I know it breaks a lot of rules, it could be this, it could do that, but I really liked it.  It''s raw and it''s real and got a superior vote from me.  Good job!</td>', 'This is a great image.  I know it breaks a lot of rules, it could be this, it could do that, but I really liked it.  It''s raw and it''s real and got a superior vote from me.  Good job!', '2007-01-14 23:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
