(3232517, 449255, 46993, '<td valign="top">Great detail, great range of tones, the cigarette gives it a little ''life'' and helps nudge it up past a traditional studio shot- I think that''s what you have to do to ribbon- you have to take a chance and try something a little different.</td>', 'Great detail, great range of tones, the cigarette gives it a little ''life'' and helps nudge it up past a traditional studio shot- I think that''s what you have to do to ribbon- you have to take a chance and try something a little different.', '2007-01-14 23:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
