(3232542, 450804, 46993, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I came back to take one more look.  Great model.  The lighting on the hair and face is superior.  I think this is maybe the best shot of the contest.  I''m bumping this up (I had given it a 9) because I like it that much.  You even managed to salvage that eye that must''ve been fairly dark under that shadow.  I love this shot.</td>', 'Great shot, I came back to take one more look.  Great model.  The lighting on the hair and face is superior.  I think this is maybe the best shot of the contest.  I''m bumping this up (I had given it a 9) because I like it that much.  You even managed to salvage that eye that must''ve been fairly dark under that shadow.  I love this shot.', '2007-01-14 23:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
