(3232566, 450627, 36403, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Daughter looks a lot like mom!  I would bring the mom in a lot closer... with her standing so tall it looks like she''s separate &amp; distant from the dad &amp; daughter.  Also, zoom in.  For family shots, the closer your subjects are to one another the better.  It''s all about touch, closeness, &amp; faces.  Hope that helps a little!</td>', 'Wow!  Daughter looks a lot like mom!  I would bring the mom in a lot closer... with her standing so tall it looks like she''s separate & distant from the dad & daughter.  Also, zoom in.  For family shots, the closer your subjects are to one another the better.  It''s all about touch, closeness, & faces.  Hope that helps a little!', '2007-01-14 23:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
