(3234327, 449501, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hurting for models were you?  :D  I''m thinking you''re probably going to get hammered on this one as most people think of portraits as a person shot, sometimes pets.  Additionally, having to write a lengthy descriptive title is many times frowned upon with the believe that your photo should do most of the talking.  All JMO of course.  As for this image, it''s composed ok and you have a good tonal range of B/W overall.  The lens flare upper-left is distracting.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Hurting for models were you?  :D  I''m thinking you''re probably going to get hammered on this one as most people think of portraits as a person shot, sometimes pets.  Additionally, having to write a lengthy descriptive title is many times frowned upon with the believe that your photo should do most of the talking.  All JMO of course.  As for this image, it''s composed ok and you have a good tonal range of B/W overall.  The lens flare upper-left is distracting.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2007-01-15 10:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3234334, 450637, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the expression and posturing of ''Ben''.  The photo is a little bit on the soft side, which takes away from it some.  Personally, I think the lighting could be a little stronger yet.  All JMO of course.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the expression and posturing of ''Ben''.  The photo is a little bit on the soft side, which takes away from it some.  Personally, I think the lighting could be a little stronger yet.  All JMO of course.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-15 10:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
