(3237139, 450453, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the head scarf, but the image seems a little bit dark.  I can see where you''ve adjusted the lighting to emphasize her eyes...just not quite enough overall IMO (and yes, my monitor is calibrated).  :D  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the head scarf, but the image seems a little bit dark.  I can see where you''ve adjusted the lighting to emphasize her eyes...just not quite enough overall IMO (and yes, my monitor is calibrated).  :D  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2007-01-15 21:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3237144, 447967, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute!  This is one of those rare times that I like a long title.  :D  This is a great image and would probably do well for you as a stock photo.  As a portrait shot...well, I''m not certain.  Wonderful clarity and sharpness where it counts.  Overall, nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Cute!  This is one of those rare times that I like a long title.  :D  This is a great image and would probably do well for you as a stock photo.  As a portrait shot...well, I''m not certain.  Wonderful clarity and sharpness where it counts.  Overall, nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-15 21:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3237164, 448402, 30049, '<td valign="top">This certainly has it''s place in the family album.  Nice shot of Grandpa.  As a portrait in the type being looked for in the challenge, its'' not quite there technically.  Mostly the lighting is too harsh IMO, and overall it''s a little soft (or perhaps it appears soft around his eyes because of the way they seem to be squinting).  All JMO of course.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This certainly has it''s place in the family album.  Nice shot of Grandpa.  As a portrait in the type being looked for in the challenge, its'' not quite there technically.  Mostly the lighting is too harsh IMO, and overall it''s a little soft (or perhaps it appears soft around his eyes because of the way they seem to be squinting).  All JMO of course.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-15 21:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3237170, 449507, 30049, '<td valign="top">First thing I thought of is "creative" composition.  Second thing I thought of is pretty extreme high contrast.  In this photo the high contrast actually works pretty well.  Don''t know if this was staged or candid, but good eye to see it nonetheless.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'First thing I thought of is "creative" composition.  Second thing I thought of is pretty extreme high contrast.  In this photo the high contrast actually works pretty well.  Don''t know if this was staged or candid, but good eye to see it nonetheless.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-15 21:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3237183, 448508, 30049, '<td valign="top">First, I''m sure you''ve heard this a dozen times already, but it bears repeating...use the maximum 640 on the long side.  You lose impact and details with a smaller size.  On the positive end I guess, you get lots of comments.  :D  As a photo I really like what you''ve done in post-processing this.  Great tonal range for a B/W - you''ve covered the range completely without blowing it out or losing details in the shadows.  The focus on her face has a soft quality to it in a good way.  Overall, nicely done.  Just show it off a bit more.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'First, I''m sure you''ve heard this a dozen times already, but it bears repeating...use the maximum 640 on the long side.  You lose impact and details with a smaller size.  On the positive end I guess, you get lots of comments.  :D  As a photo I really like what you''ve done in post-processing this.  Great tonal range for a B/W - you''ve covered the range completely without blowing it out or losing details in the shadows.  The focus on her face has a soft quality to it in a good way.  Overall, nicely done.  Just show it off a bit more.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-15 21:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3237200, 450567, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Great detail and clarity here.  Intense look in her eyes.  Nice positioning in the frame. The tiara (sp?) is shimmering.  Well done!  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Wow!  Great detail and clarity here.  Intense look in her eyes.  Nice positioning in the frame. The tiara (sp?) is shimmering.  Well done!  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2007-01-15 21:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
