(3237602, 449062, 67841, '<td valign="top">Pensive &amp; contemplative pose - not sure how many artists could pull this one off...   <br/> <br/>I love how all points lead the eyes with nothing else on any other plane to distract the viewers attention.  The lighting is nigh spot on with perfect backlighting - I love how it brought out the grittiness in the face just enough to provide a grounding realism &amp; authenticity to the pose.  <br/> <br/>Enviably executed...  &lt;&lt; 10 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'Pensive & contemplative pose - not sure how many artists could pull this one off...    I love how all points lead the eyes with nothing else on any other plane to distract the viewers attention.  The lighting is nigh spot on with perfect backlighting - I love how it brought out the grittiness in the face just enough to provide a grounding realism & authenticity to the pose.   Enviably executed...  << 10 >>', '2007-01-15 23:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
