(3237628, 450771, 67841, '<td valign="top">Compelling &amp; disturbing all at once.  I did not favor this one when I first went through - looking w/o voting - but coming through again reveals tom me how fickle even my own taste can be sometimes - ha ha...<br/> <br/>I like what the light does here, but in this instance I find the grain detracts from my impression.  Yes, it does do so much to counter the porcelain doll cliché but I almost feel like glossing the skin would have balanced it, adding a deeper sense of irony...<br/> <br/>&lt;&lt; 8 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'Compelling & disturbing all at once.  I did not favor this one when I first went through - looking w/o voting - but coming through again reveals tom me how fickle even my own taste can be sometimes - ha ha... I like what the light does here, but in this instance I find the grain detracts from my impression.  Yes, it does do so much to counter the porcelain doll cliché but I almost feel like glossing the skin would have balanced it, adding a deeper sense of irony... << 8 >>', '2007-01-15 23:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
