(3237662, 447239, 67841, '<td valign="top">Stunning features - I love how your light placement did such a wonderful job of accentuating them.<br/> <br/>Her pose has a story about it as well, excellent direction.  <br/> <br/>The tones &amp; contrast are perfect - I only wish that in this particular case there was either more or less happening in the background...  &lt;&lt; 9 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'Stunning features - I love how your light placement did such a wonderful job of accentuating them. Her pose has a story about it as well, excellent direction.   The tones & contrast are perfect - I only wish that in this particular case there was either more or less happening in the background...  << 9 >>', '2007-01-15 23:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
