(3238312, 448939, 13602, '<td valign="top">I like it alot, I only wish the knob of the camera on the right of whatever it is would be a bit out of focus, that would enhance it alot by not making it so distracting. It''s good anyways.</td>', 'I like it alot, I only wish the knob of the camera on the right of whatever it is would be a bit out of focus, that would enhance it alot by not making it so distracting. It''s good anyways.', '2007-01-16 02:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3238321, 448964, 62807, '<td valign="top">This just has to win the ribbon, Absolutely stunning!!!! I don''t think any other picture that this little girl has taken of her will ever capture her the way you have. Just beautiful!!! Would love to be able to take a photo of my little girls like this someday. (tips welcome;) A much deserved 10!!!!!!!</td>', 'This just has to win the ribbon, Absolutely stunning!!!! I don''t think any other picture that this little girl has taken of her will ever capture her the way you have. Just beautiful!!! Would love to be able to take a photo of my little girls like this someday. (tips welcome;) A much deserved 10!!!!!!!', '2007-01-16 02:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
