(3239212, 447136, 53147, '<td valign="top">Nice clean and well balanced image. Just a nice overall fun and unforced looking image. Well done - 8.</td>', 'Nice clean and well balanced image. Just a nice overall fun and unforced looking image. Well done - 8.', '2007-01-16 08:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3239218, 448964, 53147, '<td valign="top">Once again - very strong work. An excellent image. Your high key attempt works great with ths strong contrast and detail in her eyes IMHO. Keep this up along with the work in your portfolio and you will be rewarded well here at DPC.</td>', 'Once again - very strong work. An excellent image. Your high key attempt works great with ths strong contrast and detail in her eyes IMHO. Keep this up along with the work in your portfolio and you will be rewarded well here at DPC.', '2007-01-16 08:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3239219, 447173, 53147, '<td valign="top">Well this image was quite the shock opening up. Having just voted on almost 100 black and white images to see this image full of color come up was a stunner. Had I not spent the extra second I did compared to many of the other entries my finger probably would have hit the 3 button quick. I expect that you are recieving many DNMC votes and comments on this one. But not here. No where in the challenge description does ot say that your entry must be a black and white converted image. While a bit out of the box (just a bit) I think that you met the challenge well and in a gutsy way. The image is strong and pleasing, the red background really makes this stand out even more than in comparison to the images around it. My only real complaint is the border. I am not too keen on the design and the orange strip just doesnt really go well with any of the colors that are in your image. I hope you arent getting hit too hard here. You get an 8 from me counting the extra point awarded for sheer balls. Good luck and I look forward to seeing where this image falls.</td>', 'Well this image was quite the shock opening up. Having just voted on almost 100 black and white images to see this image full of color come up was a stunner. Had I not spent the extra second I did compared to many of the other entries my finger probably would have hit the 3 button quick. I expect that you are recieving many DNMC votes and comments on this one. But not here. No where in the challenge description does ot say that your entry must be a black and white converted image. While a bit out of the box (just a bit) I think that you met the challenge well and in a gutsy way. The image is strong and pleasing, the red background really makes this stand out even more than in comparison to the images around it. My only real complaint is the border. I am not too keen on the design and the orange strip just doesnt really go well with any of the colors that are in your image. I hope you arent getting hit too hard here. You get an 8 from me counting the extra point awarded for sheer balls. Good luck and I look forward to seeing where this image falls.', '2007-01-16 08:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3239225, 450642, 53147, '<td valign="top">Hey - I know this little boy! I think had you caught him looking right at you this image would have really been great - not that it isnt good right now. Great smile and nice detail in his eyes.</td>', 'Hey - I know this little boy! I think had you caught him looking right at you this image would have really been great - not that it isnt good right now. Great smile and nice detail in his eyes.', '2007-01-16 08:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3239232, 447872, 53147, '<td valign="top">Excellent image. Very nice detail and his stare has a forlorn kind of fell. Not depressed but as if he might have some suffering going on in his life. That or he is just getting tired of you taking his picture ;). Whatever it is I think this is on eof the better images in the challenge. Hope it does well foryou. Bumping up to 9.</td>', 'Excellent image. Very nice detail and his stare has a forlorn kind of fell. Not depressed but as if he might have some suffering going on in his life. That or he is just getting tired of you taking his picture ;). Whatever it is I think this is on eof the better images in the challenge. Hope it does well foryou. Bumping up to 9.', '2007-01-16 08:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3239236, 447875, 53147, '<td valign="top">I really like these types of images taken of real people on the streets.  This is a great pose, interesting character and well edited. Excellent capture. Bumping upt o 9.</td>', 'I really like these types of images taken of real people on the streets.  This is a great pose, interesting character and well edited. Excellent capture. Bumping upt o 9.', '2007-01-16 08:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3239242, 447026, 53147, '<td valign="top">Nice and creepy image. Excellent editing. The eye might be a bit soft but that is only a very fine nitpick - didnt affect my vote any. 8</td>', 'Nice and creepy image. Excellent editing. The eye might be a bit soft but that is only a very fine nitpick - didnt affect my vote any. 8', '2007-01-16 08:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
