(3239264, 450467, 53147, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Her environment really adds alot to the image - not that she isnt interesting on her own. The patterns of the tablecloth and wall hanging along with the wine bottle and plant just give this a great artistic feel to it. Verynice. 8</td>', 'Great capture. Her environment really adds alot to the image - not that she isnt interesting on her own. The patterns of the tablecloth and wall hanging along with the wine bottle and plant just give this a great artistic feel to it. Verynice. 8', '2007-01-16 08:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3239273, 447482, 53147, '<td valign="top">Man - I get so sick of people using themselves as models in these challenges. Dont you know anybody else to take pictures of? The only people worse than the likes of you are those that take so many pictures of their kids. Its sickening I tell ya! Oh yeah - and bumping up one.</td>', 'Man - I get so sick of people using themselves as models in these challenges. Dont you know anybody else to take pictures of? The only people worse than the likes of you are those that take so many pictures of their kids. Its sickening I tell ya! Oh yeah - and bumping up one.', '2007-01-16 08:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
