(3239857, 450499, 30049, '<td valign="top">The title matches the "expression" on the dogs face for sure.  :D  If you''re going to enter a pet portrait in a portrait challenge (where most are expecting people shots) then it has to be an above average photo IMO.  This is too grainy, soft, and flat (needs contrast) to hit the "wow, look at me" radar of the voters.  Because of that, plus being a pet photo, you''re most likely getting hammered a bit.  All JMO of course.  Good luck.</td>', 'The title matches the "expression" on the dogs face for sure.  :D  If you''re going to enter a pet portrait in a portrait challenge (where most are expecting people shots) then it has to be an above average photo IMO.  This is too grainy, soft, and flat (needs contrast) to hit the "wow, look at me" radar of the voters.  Because of that, plus being a pet photo, you''re most likely getting hammered a bit.  All JMO of course.  Good luck.', '2007-01-16 10:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3239869, 450835, 21816, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture. Fantastic tones.</td>', 'Wonderful capture. Fantastic tones.', '2007-01-16 10:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
