(3241733, 450842, 39121, '<td valign="top">Brilliant lighting, composition. I love this photo. The only thing that stops me giving this a 10 is I find the sleeve on the left arm (right in the image) a touch too close to the mouth and a bit distracting. You''ve done a fantastic job here. 9</td>', 'Brilliant lighting, composition. I love this photo. The only thing that stops me giving this a 10 is I find the sleeve on the left arm (right in the image) a touch too close to the mouth and a bit distracting. You''ve done a fantastic job here. 9', '2007-01-16 18:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241738, 450245, 32767, '<td valign="top">Why''s the sword in this picture? I assume there''s a connection but I''m not making it. Without the sword I''d give this higher points. Good Luck.</td>', 'Why''s the sword in this picture? I assume there''s a connection but I''m not making it. Without the sword I''d give this higher points. Good Luck.', '2007-01-16 18:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
