(3242011, 450528, 30049, '<td valign="top">I hate to see what you call ''cuddly'' if this is ''cute''!  :D  Certainly different.  Good luck.</td>', 'I hate to see what you call ''cuddly'' if this is ''cute''!  :D  Certainly different.  Good luck.', '2007-01-16 19:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3242020, 450612, 30049, '<td valign="top">Beautiful eyes.  The lips don''t seem quite right for the expression, but otherwise nicely done (exposure, lighting, focus, etc...).  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful eyes.  The lips don''t seem quite right for the expression, but otherwise nicely done (exposure, lighting, focus, etc...).  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-16 19:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3242021, 448518, 45115, '<td valign="top">sherm... always looking great ;) good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'sherm... always looking great ;) good luck in the challenge!', '2007-01-16 19:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3242069, 450675, 9581, '<td valign="top">This is really creative with the ivy leaves. Its got a good moody or attitude here, the only thing that perhaps could help really make this shot hot is maybe more focus with less grain. Although I still like it and get a lot of shots of my own with the grain sometimes thinking that it makes a image not so flat depending on a subject. ;)</td>', 'This is really creative with the ivy leaves. Its got a good moody or attitude here, the only thing that perhaps could help really make this shot hot is maybe more focus with less grain. Although I still like it and get a lot of shots of my own with the grain sometimes thinking that it makes a image not so flat depending on a subject. ;)', '2007-01-16 19:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3242076, 449198, 9581, '<td valign="top">One of the best!</td>', 'One of the best!', '2007-01-16 19:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3242080, 450295, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hi Julie.  I can''t believe I''m seeing this image here in this challenge after you''d posted it and garnered substantial feedback on how to improve it, etc...<br/> <br/>Generally, that''s considered poor etiquette for challenge entries.  Blows the whole anonymity thing and all - plus with all the feedback you''ve, in essence, collaborated on the creation of this (which is also a no-no, this one''s in the rules).<br/> <br/>I understand you''re pretty new to this.  Perhaps I''m only one of a few that''ve noticed this and will remember it from the forum.  :)<br/> <br/>Good luck!</td>', 'Hi Julie.  I can''t believe I''m seeing this image here in this challenge after you''d posted it and garnered substantial feedback on how to improve it, etc... Generally, that''s considered poor etiquette for challenge entries.  Blows the whole anonymity thing and all - plus with all the feedback you''ve, in essence, collaborated on the creation of this (which is also a no-no, this one''s in the rules). I understand you''re pretty new to this.  Perhaps I''m only one of a few that''ve noticed this and will remember it from the forum.  :) Good luck!', '2007-01-16 19:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
