(3242136, 448533, 1368, '<td valign="top">its to small, not in focus, not a portrait and too contrasty... are you trying to get the brown?</td>', 'its to small, not in focus, not a portrait and too contrasty... are you trying to get the brown?', '2007-01-16 19:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
