(3243531, 447173, 60862, '<td valign="top">Hey, Jeb, I think you did exactly what you wanted to do.  You took a good pic, you tested the boundaries, and you got out with your skin intact.  Certainly you have plenty of positive comments to go with the DNMC folks.  I must admit, I probably would''ve leapt for a low score had I voted this challenge, but your title would''ve made me think, and I probably would''ve ended up on 6.</td>', 'Hey, Jeb, I think you did exactly what you wanted to do.  You took a good pic, you tested the boundaries, and you got out with your skin intact.  Certainly you have plenty of positive comments to go with the DNMC folks.  I must admit, I probably would''ve leapt for a low score had I voted this challenge, but your title would''ve made me think, and I probably would''ve ended up on 6.', '2007-01-17 00:18:41.000000', NULL, 0),
