(3243867, 450830, 64176, '<td valign="top">i voted this a 7. she''s beautiful and i would have voted 9 if her gorgeously shaped lips were not in the fog.  i didn''t know you could put a lens in the freezer!  for how long?  ...so much still to learn.  i would be so afraid to do that. yike.  i''m not sure about the title either... i get why you put gradual, but i''m not getting funk or funky from this photo.  more like gradual dream or Gradient Haze... i dunno... just thinkin'' with my fingers.  love her eyes and the curls are spunky.  maybe gradual spunk.  okay i''ll shut up now.  i really want to know how long you put the lens in the freezer for.  do tell!</td>', 'i voted this a 7. she''s beautiful and i would have voted 9 if her gorgeously shaped lips were not in the fog.  i didn''t know you could put a lens in the freezer!  for how long?  ...so much still to learn.  i would be so afraid to do that. yike.  i''m not sure about the title either... i get why you put gradual, but i''m not getting funk or funky from this photo.  more like gradual dream or Gradient Haze... i dunno... just thinkin'' with my fingers.  love her eyes and the curls are spunky.  maybe gradual spunk.  okay i''ll shut up now.  i really want to know how long you put the lens in the freezer for.  do tell!', '2007-01-17 00:57:35.000000', NULL, 0),
