(3243888, 447645, 70828, '<td valign="top">On second look ... I think that cropping it just below the collarbone would be a much better shot that does not have the carpet and cleavage distracting from a beautifully exposed and focused shot. I agree that her cup size is not relevent to this challenge. Don''t forget that I think this is a gorgeous shot ...</td>', 'On second look ... I think that cropping it just below the collarbone would be a much better shot that does not have the carpet and cleavage distracting from a beautifully exposed and focused shot. I agree that her cup size is not relevent to this challenge. Don''t forget that I think this is a gorgeous shot ...', '2007-01-17 01:01:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(3243894, 450862, 46336, '<td valign="top">Hi Danielle, <br/> <br/>Lovely shot - the perspective works well. The real strength here is the calm of the women with the lines leading to the hand and face. What muckpond said - the motion blur really draws the eye in, and then doesn''t give the viewer anythign to be interested in. I think you have struggled with the colour depth with the bright guitar and dark face - difficult to make a balanced exposure on that range.</td>', 'Hi Danielle,  Lovely shot - the perspective works well. The real strength here is the calm of the women with the lines leading to the hand and face. What muckpond said - the motion blur really draws the eye in, and then doesn''t give the viewer anythign to be interested in. I think you have struggled with the colour depth with the bright guitar and dark face - difficult to make a balanced exposure on that range.', '2007-01-17 01:02:55.000000', NULL, 0),
