(3243957, 449767, 34659, '<td valign="top">I had this pegged for the front page.  I gave it a 9 (I only gave 1 10 in this challenge).  I think it was one of the best lit &amp; edited shots in the competition.  I know that some may think that it could have used more contrast, but I thought it was a very insightful and "natural" decision not to overdo it.  Well done &amp; congratulations on a great shot.</td>', 'I had this pegged for the front page.  I gave it a 9 (I only gave 1 10 in this challenge).  I think it was one of the best lit & edited shots in the competition.  I know that some may think that it could have used more contrast, but I thought it was a very insightful and "natural" decision not to overdo it.  Well done & congratulations on a great shot.', '2007-01-17 01:14:18.000000', NULL, 0),
