(3243999, 447876, 31133, '<td valign="top">David, congratulations on another great challenge entry. I am surprised this isn''t much closer to the top, but glad to see there was some appreciation from the voters. However, none of that matters: you have a wonderful image of this guy James, and I bet he''s going to be thrilled to have a print of this. It will look nice in the museum, too. The lighting is stunning, really perfect. He''s not a bad looking guy either :-)</td>', 'David, congratulations on another great challenge entry. I am surprised this isn''t much closer to the top, but glad to see there was some appreciation from the voters. However, none of that matters: you have a wonderful image of this guy James, and I bet he''s going to be thrilled to have a print of this. It will look nice in the museum, too. The lighting is stunning, really perfect. He''s not a bad looking guy either :-)', '2007-01-17 01:20:18.000000', NULL, 0),
