(3244172, 449369, 64176, '<td valign="top">I was one of your 4 9''s.  I love close up portraits of the elderly.  I love the authenticity of this shot.  Wow, I can''t believe more people didn''t connect with this one.  Your mom looks like she''s thinking of days gone by, and there''s some soft yearning in her eyes.  And I love her for letting you take her portrait even though her lipstick has come off.  103 5''s?  Wow.  This is going into my favorites.  Tell Mom I say hello and thanks for introducing her to us.</td>', 'I was one of your 4 9''s.  I love close up portraits of the elderly.  I love the authenticity of this shot.  Wow, I can''t believe more people didn''t connect with this one.  Your mom looks like she''s thinking of days gone by, and there''s some soft yearning in her eyes.  And I love her for letting you take her portrait even though her lipstick has come off.  103 5''s?  Wow.  This is going into my favorites.  Tell Mom I say hello and thanks for introducing her to us.', '2007-01-17 01:49:33.000000', NULL, 0),
