(3244504, 450496, 38127, '<td valign="top">Aww hunny this should have placed higher its a beautiful portrait and I love the processing  (still trying to figure out how to get the focus so clear in different places.. eyes and mouth yet nose is soft) but the eyes and mouth are where I should be looking cuz they are magical.. Love it! <br/></td>', 'Aww hunny this should have placed higher its a beautiful portrait and I love the processing  (still trying to figure out how to get the focus so clear in different places.. eyes and mouth yet nose is soft) but the eyes and mouth are where I should be looking cuz they are magical.. Love it! ', '2007-01-17 03:29:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3244512, 450227, 30982, '<td valign="top">It wasn''t ill-conceived.  It is in fact a lovely portrait - great lighting, and you''ve done whatever it is you do to the eyes to make them beyond clear - they shine.  And tell your daughter she''s a perfectly wonderful model - very expressive, very beautiful!</td>', 'It wasn''t ill-conceived.  It is in fact a lovely portrait - great lighting, and you''ve done whatever it is you do to the eyes to make them beyond clear - they shine.  And tell your daughter she''s a perfectly wonderful model - very expressive, very beautiful!', '2007-01-17 03:32:01.000000', NULL, 0),
