(3244556, 448813, 48954, '<td valign="top">he reminds me of Kenneth Braughna ( how ever yous spell that). Good shot. i would have never guessed this was yours. you clrealy did better than me. I got 9 2''s and 33 4''s!!! what a load of crap....anyways, good work.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-18 06:54:19.</i></td>', 'he reminds me of Kenneth Braughna ( how ever yous spell that). Good shot. i would have never guessed this was yours. you clrealy did better than me. I got 9 2''s and 33 4''s!!! what a load of crap....anyways, good work.', '2007-01-17 03:46:53.000000', '2007-01-18 06:54:19.000000', 0),
