(3244736, 448837, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the innocence of this.  From a photography perspective, the light is nice and even and focus is very good.  The composition/crop feels a bit off-balanced to me - between the composition and the angle the picture is taken at, the focus of the shot seems to be the nose and I''d prefer it to be the eyes.  Hopefully this makes sense.</td>', 'I like the innocence of this.  From a photography perspective, the light is nice and even and focus is very good.  The composition/crop feels a bit off-balanced to me - between the composition and the angle the picture is taken at, the focus of the shot seems to be the nose and I''d prefer it to be the eyes.  Hopefully this makes sense.', '2007-01-17 05:26:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(3244737, 450389, 71268, '<td valign="top">For me you lived up to your own set challenge, her skin and eyes look very natural. Good scoring a 10, but i liked this one even better (top 5).</td>', 'For me you lived up to your own set challenge, her skin and eyes look very natural. Good scoring a 10, but i liked this one even better (top 5).', '2007-01-17 05:27:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3244742, 450642, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m partial, because I think he''s a darn cute kid and he has the most gorgeous eyes.  Good even lighting on his face, nice catchlights and pretty good B&amp;W conversion.  I really like the choice of dark clothing and a dark background - highlights your subject very well.</td>', 'I''m partial, because I think he''s a darn cute kid and he has the most gorgeous eyes.  Good even lighting on his face, nice catchlights and pretty good B&W conversion.  I really like the choice of dark clothing and a dark background - highlights your subject very well.', '2007-01-17 05:30:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(3244751, 450530, 30982, '<td valign="top">I just read through all your comments - it seems to me that the really interesting, really good shots inspire comments both strongly positive and strongly negative - you get reactions.  This is a fine shot - strong diagonal, good tonality, but what it really has going with it is "reaction" - it makes people stop, look, and think about it.</td>', 'I just read through all your comments - it seems to me that the really interesting, really good shots inspire comments both strongly positive and strongly negative - you get reactions.  This is a fine shot - strong diagonal, good tonality, but what it really has going with it is "reaction" - it makes people stop, look, and think about it.', '2007-01-17 05:33:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3244757, 450618, 30982, '<td valign="top">I think the softness here is very appealiing, and your model looks to be a very engaging, personable, and lovely young lady.  You''ve captured her personality well.  I like the angle of the shot, and the fact you didn''t feel the need to make sure all of her hair/head was in the frame.</td>', 'I think the softness here is very appealiing, and your model looks to be a very engaging, personable, and lovely young lady.  You''ve captured her personality well.  I like the angle of the shot, and the fact you didn''t feel the need to make sure all of her hair/head was in the frame.', '2007-01-17 05:35:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3244762, 450545, 22781, '<td valign="top">Great! Simply great!</td>', 'Great! Simply great!', '2007-01-17 05:36:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(3244768, 447633, 47483, '<td valign="top">It was very good one. thnks for kind comments on my image. I did not think about scoring high for my image, just wanted to be creative. I hardly spend time doing photography, so for the time i spend, i got much more in return. Bye and congs for the membership, keep up the enthusiasm.</td>', 'It was very good one. thnks for kind comments on my image. I did not think about scoring high for my image, just wanted to be creative. I hardly spend time doing photography, so for the time i spend, i got much more in return. Bye and congs for the membership, keep up the enthusiasm.', '2007-01-17 05:38:04.000000', NULL, 0),
