(3245346, 450389, 62187, '<td valign="top">For what it''s worth, I''d prefer to see (at this website) a pretty face with ''accessories'' like you have chosen to photograph for this challenge. I wondered why the photograph that won the blue ribbon did so well. I gave it a 9 because it was, after all, a good photo but then I looked again and said ''Ohh..those are why'' I gave your photo a 10 and hope you keep trying new dimentions like this...thanks.</td>', 'For what it''s worth, I''d prefer to see (at this website) a pretty face with ''accessories'' like you have chosen to photograph for this challenge. I wondered why the photograph that won the blue ribbon did so well. I gave it a 9 because it was, after all, a good photo but then I looked again and said ''Ohh..those are why'' I gave your photo a 10 and hope you keep trying new dimentions like this...thanks.', '2007-01-17 08:02:46.000000', NULL, 0),
