(3245443, 450054, 66348, '<td valign="top">Bro this shoulda been a def. top 10 spot. Maybe because of all the entries. Whatever the case, I love how you got a model that brought the best part out on a woman, Her lips....Beautiful lips, sharpness on her eyes is great. Composition is right on, thats where I think I messed up on my shot, and your DOF is right on also. Well done Larus, Top 10 in my book.</td>', 'Bro this shoulda been a def. top 10 spot. Maybe because of all the entries. Whatever the case, I love how you got a model that brought the best part out on a woman, Her lips....Beautiful lips, sharpness on her eyes is great. Composition is right on, thats where I think I messed up on my shot, and your DOF is right on also. Well done Larus, Top 10 in my book.', '2007-01-17 08:18:26.000000', NULL, 0),
