(3245517, 447817, 71376, '<td valign="top">Hey thanks everyone for voting and leaving some very helpful suggestions... this was my first entry to the website and one of the very first few pics i have ever clicked using an SLR!... <br/>as far as the editing goes, this is again the first time i used photoshop in my life! so i am still not too unhappy about my 78th position! i hope to submit sumthin better the next time.. thanks much to all!</td>', 'Hey thanks everyone for voting and leaving some very helpful suggestions... this was my first entry to the website and one of the very first few pics i have ever clicked using an SLR!... as far as the editing goes, this is again the first time i used photoshop in my life! so i am still not too unhappy about my 78th position! i hope to submit sumthin better the next time.. thanks much to all!', '2007-01-17 08:29:40.000000', NULL, 0),
