(3247144, 447894, 63398, '<td valign="top">From a personal preference position, I don''t care for the motion blur or the cropping/missed portion of the head. The cat definitely adds to the composition, I like the sparkle in the eyes.....it''s a pleasing all ''round composition.....good light and shadows.</td>', 'From a personal preference position, I don''t care for the motion blur or the cropping/missed portion of the head. The cat definitely adds to the composition, I like the sparkle in the eyes.....it''s a pleasing all ''round composition.....good light and shadows.', '2007-01-17 14:03:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3247162, 447852, 63398, '<td valign="top">Great composition IMHO.....the title says sunbather, I like the harsh light and the very distinct shadow. The model is more than pleasing enough to the eye to withstand the stark light and with the subject off center just a tad, it just plain works for me! As to the sunglasses, who''d be out in that sun without ''em?<br/> <br/>EDIT TO ADD: I am surprised at how much definition there is on the off side of her face where I would expect it to be too dark. I also like the crisp detail.....the clarity of the left earring is a nice detail.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-17 14:10:27.</i></td>', 'Great composition IMHO.....the title says sunbather, I like the harsh light and the very distinct shadow. The model is more than pleasing enough to the eye to withstand the stark light and with the subject off center just a tad, it just plain works for me! As to the sunglasses, who''d be out in that sun without ''em? EDIT TO ADD: I am surprised at how much definition there is on the off side of her face where I would expect it to be too dark. I also like the crisp detail.....the clarity of the left earring is a nice detail.', '2007-01-17 14:07:21.000000', '2007-01-17 14:10:27.000000', 0),
(3247254, 450545, 25397, '<td valign="top">too developed to be respected by many voters in this challenge<br/> <br/>one of your best. would look great mounted on a huge canvas overlooking a big space</td>', 'too developed to be respected by many voters in this challenge one of your best. would look great mounted on a huge canvas overlooking a big space', '2007-01-17 14:20:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3247301, 450805, 30982, '<td valign="top">A sweet, natural, warm portrait.  It may need a bit more in lighting but you got the important part, and that''s passing along a bit of the person''s personality.</td>', 'A sweet, natural, warm portrait.  It may need a bit more in lighting but you got the important part, and that''s passing along a bit of the person''s personality.', '2007-01-17 14:27:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3247436, 450496, 19952, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favorites from this challenge and I thought it would score even higher. Absolutely beautiful portrait.</td>', 'This was one of my favorites from this challenge and I thought it would score even higher. Absolutely beautiful portrait.', '2007-01-17 15:00:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3247545, 450545, 70, '<td valign="top">Good of you to let Bill borrow your shirt.</td>', 'Good of you to let Bill borrow your shirt.', '2007-01-17 15:20:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3247568, 447633, 63244, '<td valign="top">omg!  This is priceless.  I really love the expression and the pose. Lighting is great and the pp is amazing. Well done!!  Putting in my faves.</td>', 'omg!  This is priceless.  I really love the expression and the pose. Lighting is great and the pp is amazing. Well done!!  Putting in my faves.', '2007-01-17 15:23:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(3247645, 447611, 63244, '<td valign="top">Very interesting concept.  Abstract thinking for sure.  I''m not sure how I feel about it, lol.  But I keep looking at it! :)</td>', 'Very interesting concept.  Abstract thinking for sure.  I''m not sure how I feel about it, lol.  But I keep looking at it! :)', '2007-01-17 15:34:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(3247651, 448837, 63398, '<td valign="top">First.....what strikes me in the negative. I''m pretty sure it''s a hangup of mine, but with people, I hate face/head cropping, that''s just subjective. Another thing, one that I do, is have a tendency to have blown out highlights......it''s ever so slight in this.<br/> <br/>What I do like.....this is a powerful, gripping emotive expression on this youngster''s face making me wonder what the trouble or disenchantment may be. A very good capture and the detail is terrific.<br/> <br/>I like the soulful look in the eyes.<br/> <br/>EDIT: I keep looking at these after I comment and I see more. I particularly like the negative space behind the child.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-17 15:36:40.</i></td>', 'First.....what strikes me in the negative. I''m pretty sure it''s a hangup of mine, but with people, I hate face/head cropping, that''s just subjective. Another thing, one that I do, is have a tendency to have blown out highlights......it''s ever so slight in this. What I do like.....this is a powerful, gripping emotive expression on this youngster''s face making me wonder what the trouble or disenchantment may be. A very good capture and the detail is terrific. I like the soulful look in the eyes. EDIT: I keep looking at these after I comment and I see more. I particularly like the negative space behind the child.', '2007-01-17 15:35:37.000000', '2007-01-17 15:36:40.000000', 0),
(3247686, 450642, 63398, '<td valign="top">VERY nice! I love the way you have captured the way his face just lights up with his smile! Great detail, crystal clear pic......good negative space behind and the light is really good. I like the dark color of the sweatshirt and the detail so crisp that the pattern of the material breaks up the smooth surfaces elsewhere. Nicely done!</td>', 'VERY nice! I love the way you have captured the way his face just lights up with his smile! Great detail, crystal clear pic......good negative space behind and the light is really good. I like the dark color of the sweatshirt and the detail so crisp that the pattern of the material breaks up the smooth surfaces elsewhere. Nicely done!', '2007-01-17 15:40:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3247740, 447894, 11854, '<td valign="top">I thought this was pretty cool and voted it fairly high. I was wondering though, who is the shadow and who is the former self? The four eyes on the cat definitely add interest.</td>', 'I thought this was pretty cool and voted it fairly high. I was wondering though, who is the shadow and who is the former self? The four eyes on the cat definitely add interest.', '2007-01-17 15:51:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3247745, 450530, 63398, '<td valign="top">Wow! You weren''t kidding when you said you''d taken a departure from the norm. Can I deduct points for your not following your own successful system?....8&gt;)<br/> <br/>It''s darkly funny, and it makes me chuckle nervously. This whole image and what it evokes is kind of Stephen King-esque......that''s a good thing, I think he''s really talented.<br/> <br/>I like the minimal focus area.....it''s so subtle I almost missed it and it relly adds to the mystery of the shot. This is a really different, edgy, evocative shot, Svetlana.....I like it.</td>', 'Wow! You weren''t kidding when you said you''d taken a departure from the norm. Can I deduct points for your not following your own successful system?....8>) It''s darkly funny, and it makes me chuckle nervously. This whole image and what it evokes is kind of Stephen King-esque......that''s a good thing, I think he''s really talented. I like the minimal focus area.....it''s so subtle I almost missed it and it relly adds to the mystery of the shot. This is a really different, edgy, evocative shot, Svetlana.....I like it.', '2007-01-17 15:51:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(3247753, 450618, 63398, '<td valign="top">I really don''t have too much to say about this one other than it''s a good rendition of a soft and pretty woman that''s just all ''round nice.<br/> <br/>It''s a little hot around the highlights, but not offensively so and it rather induces a sunny feel to the shot.<br/> <br/>Lovely smile......you definitely captured a good feeling with this.</td>', 'I really don''t have too much to say about this one other than it''s a good rendition of a soft and pretty woman that''s just all ''round nice. It''s a little hot around the highlights, but not offensively so and it rather induces a sunny feel to the shot. Lovely smile......you definitely captured a good feeling with this.', '2007-01-17 15:55:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3247856, 450770, 19708, '<td valign="top">Very natural and so nicely post-processed.<br/>This was well deserving of the <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/rib3.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/rib3.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/rib3.gif"/> Eden - Congrats!</td>', 'Very natural and so nicely post-processed.This was well deserving of the  Eden - Congrats!', '2007-01-17 16:19:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(3247923, 450545, 6388, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mk:</b></div><hr/><i> Good of you to let Bill borrow your shirt. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Real buttons are too hard.  Pearl snaps are easier.  and I find the noise they make comforting.</td>', 'Originally posted by mk: Good of you to let Bill borrow your shirt.   Real buttons are too hard.  Pearl snaps are easier.  and I find the noise they make comforting.', '2007-01-17 16:32:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(3247980, 448518, 37629, '<td valign="top">Congratulations. Amazing shot.</td>', 'Congratulations. Amazing shot.', '2007-01-17 16:39:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3248026, 450530, 60862, '<td valign="top">Oh, keep experimenting, Svetlana. :)  It wasn''t a good match for "portrait," but then you knew that when you entered it, right?  It is a good shot, though.</td>', 'Oh, keep experimenting, Svetlana. :)  It wasn''t a good match for "portrait," but then you knew that when you entered it, right?  It is a good shot, though.', '2007-01-17 16:45:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3248071, 448634, 811, '<td valign="top">CRITIQUE CLUB CRITIQUE<br/>by karmat<br/> <br/>Compositionally, I think the "awkward" crop works well with the drama and tension set up by your expression and "make up."  I''m not sure that the light at the top of your head, where just a bit of your hair is silhouetted is truly effective.  It is actually kind of distracting to me.  <br/> <br/>Technically, the exposure is right on and you have some good detail.  Also, with the neck area being softer, it helps to give some depth to the shot.<br/> <br/>Emotionally, this shot really tells a story, or at least leads the viewer to imagine one.  The black and white, the smeared black on the face all work together to build tension and emotion.<br/> <br/>Frankly, I am surprised at your score, and would have thought that it would score higher.  Reading your comments, the size thing may have also affected you, but it wasn''t that noticeable to me. It is not your typical, clean bw portrait, so that may have hurt you some, but you have an awesome shot here that you can be proud of.<br/> <br/>karmat</td>', 'CRITIQUE CLUB CRITIQUEby karmat Compositionally, I think the "awkward" crop works well with the drama and tension set up by your expression and "make up."  I''m not sure that the light at the top of your head, where just a bit of your hair is silhouetted is truly effective.  It is actually kind of distracting to me.   Technically, the exposure is right on and you have some good detail.  Also, with the neck area being softer, it helps to give some depth to the shot. Emotionally, this shot really tells a story, or at least leads the viewer to imagine one.  The black and white, the smeared black on the face all work together to build tension and emotion. Frankly, I am surprised at your score, and would have thought that it would score higher.  Reading your comments, the size thing may have also affected you, but it wasn''t that noticeable to me. It is not your typical, clean bw portrait, so that may have hurt you some, but you have an awesome shot here that you can be proud of. karmat', '2007-01-17 16:51:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(3248089, 448634, 69186, '<td valign="top">Thanks Bolti and karmat for the critique :)</td>', 'Thanks Bolti and karmat for the critique :)', '2007-01-17 16:54:58.000000', NULL, 0),
