(3250349, 450389, 44878, '<td valign="top">You probably have no idea about how thrilled I am to get so high up in this Challenge.<br/>It means a lot to me personally, as I relly tried to step outside of my box, and I think the inclusion of the Violin really helped to provoke peoples thoughts.<br/>Really pleased with all of the comments.<br/> <br/>Cheers.<br/>Joe</td>', 'You probably have no idea about how thrilled I am to get so high up in this Challenge.It means a lot to me personally, as I relly tried to step outside of my box, and I think the inclusion of the Violin really helped to provoke peoples thoughts.Really pleased with all of the comments. Cheers.Joe', '2007-01-18 05:03:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3250363, 449468, 13602, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the comments, I said it before, and I''ll say it again, this kind of feedback counts alot more than ribbons. This especially goes to Lynn (thebugsmommy), atleast for once I know why i got a 1 :D</td>', 'Thank you all for the comments, I said it before, and I''ll say it again, this kind of feedback counts alot more than ribbons. This especially goes to Lynn (thebugsmommy), atleast for once I know why i got a 1 :D', '2007-01-18 05:16:27.000000', NULL, 0),
