(3250813, 448616, 10768, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone for their comments.  This is my highest finish and it has been fun!  This is actually my daughter.  She makes my pictures look good!  I do not have a lot of photography equipment.  I used a collapsable backdrop for the background and the lighting was from a desk lamp.  Maybe it''s time to invest in some real equipment, although I was happy with these results.</td>', 'Thanks to everyone for their comments.  This is my highest finish and it has been fun!  This is actually my daughter.  She makes my pictures look good!  I do not have a lot of photography equipment.  I used a collapsable backdrop for the background and the lighting was from a desk lamp.  Maybe it''s time to invest in some real equipment, although I was happy with these results.', '2007-01-18 08:50:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3250816, 448616, 72268, '<td valign="top">I love this picture. The color''s are beautiful and the composition. Great work!</td>', 'I love this picture. The color''s are beautiful and the composition. Great work!', '2007-01-18 08:55:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3250860, 450805, 63398, '<td valign="top">A competent and emotive entry. The conversion seems to me to be a tad off......it has that grey cast that seems to be a problem with the conversion. The light on her left arm is a little bright. Enough with the nit-picking......you have managed to capture a soft sweet moment with this lovely subject, something that is all too hard to do. What a truly nice photograph.</td>', 'A competent and emotive entry. The conversion seems to me to be a tad off......it has that grey cast that seems to be a problem with the conversion. The light on her left arm is a little bright. Enough with the nit-picking......you have managed to capture a soft sweet moment with this lovely subject, something that is all too hard to do. What a truly nice photograph.', '2007-01-18 09:11:55.000000', NULL, 0),
