(3254244, 448819, 71931, '<td valign="top">I think that _eug made a good point about the "[lasric" feel, but it was one of the things that really made this photo for me.  The fact that Oman is comparatively pro-women (compared to many other Islamic countries) made this even more interesting of a shot.  I was shocked, to be honest, that this came in as low as it did, with averages under 6.  This was my #1 shot of this challenge.  Just goes to show that we all have different tastes, and hooray for that! :-)</td>', 'I think that _eug made a good point about the "[lasric" feel, but it was one of the things that really made this photo for me.  The fact that Oman is comparatively pro-women (compared to many other Islamic countries) made this even more interesting of a shot.  I was shocked, to be honest, that this came in as low as it did, with averages under 6.  This was my #1 shot of this challenge.  Just goes to show that we all have different tastes, and hooray for that! :-)', '2007-01-19 01:22:55.000000', NULL, 0),
