(3254454, 450617, 25355, '<td valign="top">It''s a portrait of a city, which I think is perfectly acceptable given that "N/A" was all that was given for the challenge description. And it''s a black and white picture.<br/> <br/>It''s the first time I''ve looked at this picture, and I''ve learnt something new - big buildings in New York are much narrower in depth than I imagined them to be. (And is that The Dakota in lower right?)</td>', 'It''s a portrait of a city, which I think is perfectly acceptable given that "N/A" was all that was given for the challenge description. And it''s a black and white picture. It''s the first time I''ve looked at this picture, and I''ve learnt something new - big buildings in New York are much narrower in depth than I imagined them to be. (And is that The Dakota in lower right?)', '2007-01-19 02:50:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(3254492, 449157, 70828, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kteach:</b></div><hr/><i> I love this shot.. I was surprised to see it''s score and placement.  I agree with Greetmir that I thought it would be higher.  I think you did a fantastic job... your friend should be very pleased! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Oh yeah! ... She is gonna want that on her wall for SURE!</td>', 'Originally posted by kteach: I love this shot.. I was surprised to see it''s score and placement.  I agree with Greetmir that I thought it would be higher.  I think you did a fantastic job... your friend should be very pleased!   Oh yeah! ... She is gonna want that on her wall for SURE!', '2007-01-19 03:02:58.000000', NULL, 0),
