(3255168, 449548, 56797, '<td valign="top">OOoooo!OooOO!! My name is in your notes!! :D awesome! I''m so honored. You did a phenomenal job. far better than mine. and I think it''s great that you didn''t focus on the eyes. this way the hat and skin and all those closer features are in perfect focus. Fantastic D.O.F. too. Congratulations. It''s well deserved.<br/> <br/>I just realized how funny this is that you called it chimney sweep and I just made this shot yesterday before reading your notes and knowing you were inspired by my pic. thats some odd coincidence.<a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=454940" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/56797/thumb/454940.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/56797/thumb/454940.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/56797/thumb/454940.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-19 12:40:29.</i></td>', 'OOoooo!OooOO!! My name is in your notes!! :D awesome! I''m so honored. You did a phenomenal job. far better than mine. and I think it''s great that you didn''t focus on the eyes. this way the hat and skin and all those closer features are in perfect focus. Fantastic D.O.F. too. Congratulations. It''s well deserved. I just realized how funny this is that you called it chimney sweep and I just made this shot yesterday before reading your notes and knowing you were inspired by my pic. thats some odd coincidence.', '2007-01-19 09:37:34.000000', '2007-01-19 12:40:29.000000', 0),
