(3261932, 450227, 48115, '<td valign="top">hihi.. I love this.. it''s so.. well just lovely. I was thinking if you could tell us what kind of lighting you did in this shot? I love the effect it dose</td>', 'hihi.. I love this.. it''s so.. well just lovely. I was thinking if you could tell us what kind of lighting you did in this shot? I love the effect it dose', '2007-01-21 09:08:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3261954, 450227, 56797, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Krisby:</b></div><hr/><i> hihi.. I love this.. it''s so.. well just lovely. I was thinking if you could tell us what kind of lighting you did in this shot? I love the effect it dose </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>sure. it was a dark room with just one soft box on.  it was off to her side and slightly in front of her. I don''t exactly know how to explain that. say if your looking at a clock(as the photogrpaher) she was at 12:00 and the softbox was standing at 8:00 o clock bout 5 feet away from her,facing torwards her of course. some of the drama was added in post processing. but the light set up was very basic. I tend to like using just one softbox for many of my shots. <br/> <br/>Hope that helps.</td>', 'Originally posted by Krisby: hihi.. I love this.. it''s so.. well just lovely. I was thinking if you could tell us what kind of lighting you did in this shot? I love the effect it dose   sure. it was a dark room with just one soft box on.  it was off to her side and slightly in front of her. I don''t exactly know how to explain that. say if your looking at a clock(as the photogrpaher) she was at 12:00 and the softbox was standing at 8:00 o clock bout 5 feet away from her,facing torwards her of course. some of the drama was added in post processing. but the light set up was very basic. I tend to like using just one softbox for many of my shots.  Hope that helps.', '2007-01-21 09:19:40.000000', NULL, 0),
