(3288144, 450764, 23394, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by debitipton:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by BradP:</b></div><hr/><i> Oh how this could have come alive had she had a great big smile to compliment her beauty. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It''s hard to smile when you are humoring your mother and when she did it was one of those cheesy school photo type smiles. I gave up and went with what I had. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>aarrrrrggghhhhhhhhhhhhhhh...oh, how i''m dreading that look...</td>', 'Originally posted by debitipton: Originally posted by BradP: Oh how this could have come alive had she had a great big smile to compliment her beauty.   It''s hard to smile when you are humoring your mother and when she did it was one of those cheesy school photo type smiles. I gave up and went with what I had.   aarrrrrggghhhhhhhhhhhhhhh...oh, how i''m dreading that look...', '2007-01-26 17:28:00.000000', NULL, 0),
