(3324305, 448162, 3724, '<td valign="top">My initial reaction was to make a comparison to the <a href="//www.dianearbus.net/pictures/grenade.htm" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Arbus</a> autistic child image as mentioned previously by Bear_Music.  It is a interesting fyi 7.<br/></td>', 'My initial reaction was to make a comparison to the Arbus autistic child image as mentioned previously by Bear_Music.  It is a interesting fyi 7.', '2007-02-03 21:29:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3324929, 449540, 60862, '<td valign="top">That''s a very sweet shot - definitely one to keep for your own memories. :)<br/> <br/>Try sharpening after resizing as well as before - the settings will be much lower than what you needed before resizing, though.</td>', 'That''s a very sweet shot - definitely one to keep for your own memories. :) Try sharpening after resizing as well as before - the settings will be much lower than what you needed before resizing, though.', '2007-02-04 01:08:48.000000', NULL, 0),
