(3343515, 447567, 64733, '<td valign="top">this was a great series of shots.  i thought some of the outtakes were ultimately stronger in the end, and the color ones were worth some merit.</td>', 'this was a great series of shots.  i thought some of the outtakes were ultimately stronger in the end, and the color ones were worth some merit.', '2007-02-08 10:07:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3345511, 448162, 62812, '<td valign="top">It''s a great shot <br/>Saying it was like thw Arbus shot is going a bit too far!<br/>Okay the angle of the head is the same and it''s black and white but that''s it.<br/>Still a fine portrait mind.</td>', 'It''s a great shot Saying it was like thw Arbus shot is going a bit too far!Okay the angle of the head is the same and it''s black and white but that''s it.Still a fine portrait mind.', '2007-02-08 19:13:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3353271, 449037, 46177, '<td valign="top">Just checking out your portfolio and found this, can''t believe it didn''t do alot better, I am definatly a fan of this type of lighting, imo, very nice shot!</td>', 'Just checking out your portfolio and found this, can''t believe it didn''t do alot better, I am definatly a fan of this type of lighting, imo, very nice shot!', '2007-02-11 15:14:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3357750, 447633, 40718, '<td valign="top">The technicals:  The processing is well done.  I do think you did a good job with the image grain.  Lighting is nice as the high contrast helps the grainy feel. (it''s probably a product of the processing as much as the original lighting).<br/> <br/>The feel: Creative expression, but much to "stylized" for me.  It''s obvious it''s a posed look.  Without the title, what would we have?  A charicature.  That probably hurt you with a number of voters, but helped greatly with a few.<br/> <br/>The game: Image grain is a tough sell here (although personally I love it).  This shot was meant to speak to a few, not the mass audience.</td>', 'The technicals:  The processing is well done.  I do think you did a good job with the image grain.  Lighting is nice as the high contrast helps the grainy feel. (it''s probably a product of the processing as much as the original lighting). The feel: Creative expression, but much to "stylized" for me.  It''s obvious it''s a posed look.  Without the title, what would we have?  A charicature.  That probably hurt you with a number of voters, but helped greatly with a few. The game: Image grain is a tough sell here (although personally I love it).  This shot was meant to speak to a few, not the mass audience.', '2007-02-12 14:59:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(3368812, 449761, 24454, '<td valign="top">I''m sure glad the voters like this as much as you and I did.  I think its beautiful!  The lighting on her face is so soft.  Unbelievable that this was taken with a 1600 ISO!   You can see the touch of "anxious" in her eyes that your story tells, which is always so nice to have such strong expression in a photo.   I hope her boyfriend and her made up.  I''m assuming they did since I saw a later photo of him washing your car :)  Yayyyy.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I''m sure glad the voters like this as much as you and I did.  I think its beautiful!  The lighting on her face is so soft.  Unbelievable that this was taken with a 1600 ISO!   You can see the touch of "anxious" in her eyes that your story tells, which is always so nice to have such strong expression in a photo.   I hope her boyfriend and her made up.  I''m assuming they did since I saw a later photo of him washing your car :)  Yayyyy. ', '2007-02-15 09:41:59.000000', NULL, 0);
