(3565554, 449754, 30982, '<td valign="top">Apparently I didn''t vote in this challenge (no red bar here to show my score).  I really like what the softened external flash did to the texture of the sweater.  Mostly I like just the one eye thing going on here.  I''m not sure how to do it - you may have to ask her - but Xianart does really cool stuff with vignettes.  Since you''ve got the start of some vignetting naturally, I think adding depth to that might be interesting.  Glad you didn''t pull it, too.</td>', 'Apparently I didn''t vote in this challenge (no red bar here to show my score).  I really like what the softened external flash did to the texture of the sweater.  Mostly I like just the one eye thing going on here.  I''m not sure how to do it - you may have to ask her - but Xianart does really cool stuff with vignettes.  Since you''ve got the start of some vignetting naturally, I think adding depth to that might be interesting.  Glad you didn''t pull it, too.', '2007-04-20 10:08:19.000000', NULL, 0),
