(3937063, 447645, 14986, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the lighting or pose on this shot.   The light seems harsh and the shadow is distracting to me.  Perhaps if she was farther away from the background.<br/> <br/>I also don''t like angle getting so much of the cleavage right out there type pose.  The strip of carpet or whatever that is under her right arm takes away from the composition as well.   I actually think a tighter crop would put the attention more on the pretty model and be more flattering.<br/> <br/>edited to add: Thank you for your  nice comment on my canyon view. My comment exchange though was for photos we perhaps didn''t care for as much (and why), so that''s why I did my comment on this portrait.  <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-07-25 18:00:47.</i></td>', 'I don''t care for the lighting or pose on this shot.   The light seems harsh and the shadow is distracting to me.  Perhaps if she was farther away from the background. I also don''t like angle getting so much of the cleavage right out there type pose.  The strip of carpet or whatever that is under her right arm takes away from the composition as well.   I actually think a tighter crop would put the attention more on the pretty model and be more flattering. edited to add: Thank you for your  nice comment on my canyon view. My comment exchange though was for photos we perhaps didn''t care for as much (and why), so that''s why I did my comment on this portrait.  ', '2007-07-25 18:58:56.000000', '2007-07-25 19:00:47.000000', 0),
